{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01B6X3UoEvWd9zbnFvxvEqD2","type":"tool_result","content":"1\texperiments:\n2\t- id: plan_001\n3\t  claim: 1\n4\t  description: SigLIP+Projector RSA vs Full VLA vs DINO — 证明 action-relevant 结构源自\n5\t    frozen vision encoder\n6\t  priority: P0\n7\t  gpu_budget_hours: 1\n8\t  deps: []\n9\t  registry_id: d027_siglip_only_rsa\n10\t  status: done\n11\t  result: RSA=0.615 >> VLA 0.488 >> DINO 0.388\n12\t- id: plan_002\n13\t  claim: 1\n14\t  description: DINO baseline RSA — standalone vision model 参照\n15\t  priority: P0\n16\t  gpu_budget_hours: 0.5\n17\t  deps: []\n18\t  registry_id: dinov2_baseline\n19\t  status: done\n20\t  result: RSA=0.388\n21\t- id: plan_003\n22\t  claim: 2\n23\t  description: Per-layer RSA curve — 追踪 RSA 从 projector output 到 LLM 各层的变换轨迹\n24\t  priority: P1\n25\t  gpu_budget_hours: 0\n26\t  deps:\n27\t  - plan_001\n28\t  registry_id: plan_003_perlayer_degradation\n29\t  status: done\n30\t  result: 'D041 definitive: Trained image_mean inverted-U (L0=0.612→L12=0.628 peak→L32=0.422).\n31\t    Untrained monotonic decay (L0=0.612→L32=0.545). Training shifts peak L0→L12.'\n32\t- id: plan_004\n33\t  claim: 2\n34\t  description: Output head analysis — SigLIP+projector frozen 确认, LLM 权重变化不传导到表征\n35\t  priority: P0\n36\t  gpu_budget_hours: 0.5\n37\t  deps: []\n38\t  registry_id: d021_output_head_analysis\n39\t  status: done\n40\t  result: Projector frozen (cos_sim=1.0), LLM 32层 rel_change 均匀分布\n41\t- id: plan_005\n42\t  claim: 3\n43\t  description: 6 probing methods × 2 benchmarks — 系统性验证 trained ≈ untrained\n44\t  priority: P0\n45\t  gpu_budget_hours: 8\n46\t  deps: []\n47\t  registry_id: mvp_probe_trained, mvp_probe_untrained, mvp2_action_trained, mvp2_action_untrained,\n48\t    mvp2_action_dino, mvp2_delta_trained, mvp2_delta_untrained, mvp2_delta_dino, lg_rsa_analysis\n49\t  status: done\n50\t  result: 'All 6 methods consistent: trained ≈ untrained >> DINO'\n51\t- id: plan_006\n52\t  claim: 3\n53\t  description: Instruction ablation — 去掉 instruction text 测 RSA 变化\n54\t  priority: P0\n55\t  gpu_budget_hours: 2\n56\t  deps: []\n57\t  registry_id: d021_instruction_ablation\n58\t  status: done\n59\t  result: Δ=0.004 << 0.10 threshold, instruction has no effect\n60\t- id: plan_007\n61\t  claim: 3\n62\t  description: 2×2 matrix (training × instruction) — 四条件全收敛\n63\t  priority: P0\n64\t  gpu_budget_hours: 1\n65\t  deps:\n66\t  - plan_006\n67\t  registry_id: d027_trained_no_inst_rsa\n68\t  status: done\n69\t  result: All 4 cells ≈ 0.48-0.49, Bootstrap CI includes 0\n70\t- id: plan_008\n71\t  claim: 3\n72\t  description: Random instruction control — 用随机/无意义 instruction 替代真实 instruction，验证\n73\t    instruction content 不影响 RSA\n74\t  priority: P1\n75\t  gpu_budget_hours: 2\n76\t  deps:\n77\t  - plan_006\n78\t  registry_id: plan_008_random_inst_control\n79\t  status: done\n80\t  result: 'All conditions within ±0.017: normal 0.489, random 0.484, shuffled 0.483,\n81\t    empty 0.472. Instruction content invariant.'\n82\t  note: 排除 trivial separability 攻击面 (D024). 三重不变性完备：training + instruction presence\n83\t    + instruction content.\n84\t- id: plan_011\n85\t  claim:\n86\t  - 1\n87\t  - 2\n88\t  - 3\n89\t  description: Full-layer R² scan — 33 layers × 2 conditions × 2 aggregations = 132\n90\t    probes，验证 R² per-layer curve 是否与 RSA inverted-U 一致\n91\t  priority: P0\n92\t  gpu_budget_hours: 1\n93\t  deps:\n94\t  - plan_001\n95\t  registry_id: plan_011_fulllayer_r2\n96\t  status: done\n97\t  result: 'R² also inverted-U. Trained peaks: imgmean L8=0.655, lastpre L13=0.678\n98\t    (both > proj 0.630). Training shifts R² peak and causes RSA-R² convergence. Untrained\n99\t    L10-L13 pathological (R²≈0). Best-vs-best: imgmean Δ=+0.015 p=0.006, lastpre Δ=+0.069\n100\t    p<0.0001.'\n101\t- id: plan_012\n102\t  claim:\n103\t  - 1\n104\t  - 2\n105\t  description: CLIP-ViT pretraining control — 用 CLIP ViT-L 替代 SigLIP，区分 VL pretraining\n106\t    贡献 vs encoder quality\n107\t  priority: P1\n108\t  gpu_budget_hours: 2\n109\t  deps:\n110\t  - plan_001\n111\t  registry_id: plan_012_clip_vit_control\n112\t  status: done\n113\t  result: 'CLIP RSA=0.557, R²=0.587. D037 corrected: CLIP < DINO (0.631) in both dimensions.\n114\t    VL pretraining does NOT improve over self-supervised.'\n115\t  note: D037 invalidated 'VL pretraining dominance' interpretation. CLIP < DINO in\n116\t    both RSA and R².\n117\t- id: plan_013\n118\t  claim:\n119\t  - 1\n120\t  description: Branch-split RSA — 从 DinoSigLIP fused backbone 分离 DINOv2 branch (1088d)\n121\t    vs SigLIP branch (1088d) RSA，定量回答 fused backbone 中各组件对 action-aligned geometry\n122\t    的贡献\n123\t  priority: P0\n124\t  gpu_budget_hours: 0\n125\t  deps:\n126\t  - plan_001\n127\t  - plan_012\n128\t  registry_id: plan_013_branch_split\n129\t  status: done\n130\t  result: DINOv2 branch=0.619 ≈ SigLIP branch=0.621. Fused 2176d=0.634 > either branch.\n131\t    Projector compresses 0.634→0.615. Both branches contribute equally.\n132\t- id: plan_009\n133\t  claim:\n134\t  - 1\n135\t  - 2\n136\t  description: CKA verification — 用 CKA 指标重复 RSA 发现，确保不是指标依赖\n137\t  priority: P2\n138\t  gpu_budget_hours: 0\n139\t  deps:\n140\t  - plan_001\n141\t  registry_id: plan_009_cka_verification\n142\t  status: done\n143\t  result: 'PARTIAL: CKA ordering reversal vs RSA (untrained > trained > projector\n144\t    > DINO). Hypothesis partially negated — CKA does NOT replicate RSA ordering. But\n145\t    dissociation itself is a finding: RSA=geometric alignment (LLM degrades), CKA=global\n146\t    structure (LLM preserves). last_preaction CKA=0.127 highest.'\n147\t  note: CPU-only. RSA-CKA dissociation = new finding. Claim 2 must scope as 'geometric\n148\t    degradation'.\n149\t- id: plan_010\n150\t  claim:\n151\t  - 1\n152\t  - 2\n153\t  - 3\n154\t  description: LIBERO-Spatial benchmark 扩展 — 第三个 benchmark 交叉验证\n155\t  priority: P2\n156\t  gpu_budget_hours: 4\n157\t  deps: []\n158\t  registry_id: plan010_action_probe_spatial\n159\t  status: preparing\n160\t  note: Director 批准启动。Data download + disk cleanup in progress.\n161\t"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":"toolu_01WoADziF2MB6dw4T3oHKVnT","session_id":"26867879-adf3-4c14-9393-b9045e867606","uuid":"b90aca35-3119-41d0-a182-98fbc0f9ded8","timestamp":"2026-05-27T02:34:37.491Z"}
