{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01VGZMKZBAGi9AiQuM6Rg2Ta","type":"tool_result","content":"600\t      - compression loss -0.019\n601\t  figures_description:\n602\t  - 'Stacked bar: branch contributions + fusion gain + projector loss'\n603\t  analysis: Equal branch contribution + complementary fusion。Projector compression\n604\t    是 RSA 降级的一个源头。\n605\t- name: OpenVLA Goal Standardized Full Pipeline\n606\t  plan_id: openvla_goal_standardized_v1\n607\t  description: 'OpenVLA (Llama-2-7B) 在 LIBERO-Goal 的标准化 5-phase pipeline。\n608\t\n609\t    Trained = openvla-7b-finetuned-libero-goal，Untrained = openvla-7b (OXE pretrained,\n610\t    970K episodes)。\n611\t\n612\t    填充 3×4 矩阵的 OpenVLA×Goal cell，提供 trained vs OXE-pretrained 对比。\n613\t\n614\t    '\n615\t  expected_results:\n616\t    trained_r2_image_mean_peak:\n617\t      layer: L9\n618\t      R2: 0.655\n619\t    trained_r2_last_preaction_peak:\n620\t      layer: L13\n621\t      R2: 0.678\n622\t    trained_r2_last_preaction_exit_L31: 0.528\n623\t    trained_exit_collapse_delta: 0.15\n624\t    untrained_r2_image_mean_peak:\n625\t      layer: L12\n626\t      R2: 0.845\n627\t    untrained_r2_image_mean_exit_L31: 0.832\n628\t    untrained_r2_last_preaction_peak:\n629\t      layer: L21\n630\t      R2: 0.825\n631\t    untrained_r2_last_preaction_exit_L31: 0.805\n632\t    untrained_exit_collapse_delta: 0.02\n633\t    trained_L1_instruction_dominant: 24\n634\t    trained_L1_total_heads: 32\n635\t    trained_L1_mean_text_attn: 0.577\n636\t    untrained_L1_instruction_dominant: 25\n637\t    untrained_L1_total_heads: 32\n638\t    untrained_L1_mean_text_attn: 0.62\n639\t    untrained_L1_mixed_heads: 7\n640\t    trained_image_mean_all_layers: 0.1\n641\t    trained_last_preaction_L1: 0.996\n642\t    trained_last_preaction_L2_plus: 1.0\n643\t    untrained_image_mean_all_layers: 0.1\n644\t    untrained_last_preaction_all_layers: 1.0\n645\t    trained_rsa_peak:\n646\t      layer: L12\n647\t      rsa: 0.628\n648\t    trained_rsa_exit_L31: 0.42\n649\t    untrained_rsa_peak:\n650\t      layer: L12\n651\t      rsa: 0.52\n652\t    untrained_rsa_exit_L31: 0.5\n653\t    trained_cf_empty_d: 0.96\n654\t    trained_cf_wrong_d: 0.91\n655\t    trained_cf_shuffled_d: 0.77\n656\t    trained_cf_paraphrased_d: 0.7\n657\t    trained_cf_ordering: empty > wrong > shuffled > paraphrased\n658\t    untrained_cf_empty_d: 1.05\n659\t    untrained_cf_wrong_d: 0.84\n660\t    untrained_cf_shuffled_d: 0.63\n661\t    untrained_cf_paraphrased_d: 0.61\n662\t    untrained_cf_ordering: empty > wrong > shuffled > paraphrased\n663\t  result_rationale: '**R² Exit Collapse (trained Δ=0.150 >> untrained Δ=0.020)**:\n664\t\n665\t    Trained 模型在 exit layers 出现 R² collapse：last_preaction 从 peak L13=0.678 下降到\n666\t\n667\t    L31=0.528（Δ=0.150），确认 exit collapse > 0.08 threshold。这与 OpenVLA Object\n668\t\n669\t    （Δ=0.121）量级一致，Goal suite 稍高因为 goal-conditioned 任务对 instruction routing\n670\t\n671\t    要求更强，exit 层需要更多 capacity 分配给 action conditioning 而非 instruction retention。\n672\t\n673\t\n674\t    Untrained (OXE pretrained) 模型几乎无 exit collapse（Δ=0.020）。OXE 的 970K episodes\n675\t\n676\t    通用训练创建了 flat R² profile（image_mean: 0.83-0.85 全程平坦；last_preaction: 从 0.61\n677\t\n678\t    monotonic rise 到 0.825 后保持），因为通用训练学到的是 general-purpose routing，不需要\n679\t\n680\t    task-specific exit collapse。R² 绝对值高于 trained 模型（0.845 vs 0.655 for image_mean）\n681\t\n682\t    因为 OXE 模型保留了更多 general action information，而 task-specific fine-tuning 牺牲了\n683\t\n684\t    generality 换取 exit-layer task specialization。\n685\t\n686\t\n687\t    **L1 Attention**: Trained 24/32 instruction-dominant 与 CLAUDE.md 既有数据一致。\n688\t\n689\t    OXE pretrained 25/32 instruction-dominant（从 openvla_long_untrained 数据外推），\n690\t\n691\t    表明 L1 routing 是 OXE pretraining 创建的（D090 base-model-dependent）。训练后 L1\n692\t\n693\t    heads 从 25→24（微小下降），说明 task-specific fine-tuning 不增强 L1 routing 而是\n694\t\n695\t    redistribute 部分 head 用于 task-specific computation。\n696\t\n697\t\n698\t    **Cross-Instruction**: Image_mean = chance (10%) 在两条件下不变（causal mask guarantee）。\n699\t\n700\t    Last_preaction trained 从 L1 即 99.6%（即时路由），untrained (OXE) 全层 100%（OXE\n701\t\n702\t    pretraining 已建立强 instruction encoding）。差异在于 untrained 的 \"100%\" 来自通用\n703\t\n704\t    routing，trained 的 \"100%\" 来自 task-specific routing — probe accuracy 饱和无法区分，\n705\t\n706\t    但 R² exit collapse 和 CF 可以。\n707\t\n708\t\n709\t    **RSA**: Trained inverted-U peak L12（0.628）与 plan_003 一致。Untrained (OXE) peak\n710\t\n711\t    也在 L12（0.52），但整体 RSA lower 因为 OXE 模型已部分重塑 geometry。\n712\t\n713\t\n714\t    **Counterfactual**: Trained CF ordering（empty>wrong>shuffled>para）与 10-task 数据\n715\t\n716\t    一致。d 值 0.70-0.96 处于中等-强效应。OXE untrained 也显示强 CF（empty d=1.05），\n717\t\n718\t    这是 D094 三层级梯度的关键证据——Tier 2 (OXE VLA) 已有 CF sensitivity（通用 routing），\n719\t\n720\t    但缺乏 exit collapse（task-specific routing）。Trained vs OXE 的 CF 差异小于 trained\n721\t\n722\t    vs VLM-base 差异，进一步支持 \"routing reshapes at task-specific transition\" 叙事。\n723\t\n724\t    '\n725\t  tables:\n726\t  - title: 'OpenVLA × Goal: R² Exit Collapse'\n727\t    columns:\n728\t    - Condition\n729\t    - R² Peak\n730\t    - Peak Layer\n731\t    - R² Exit (L31)\n732\t    - Δ (peak-exit)\n733\t    - Collapse?\n734\t    rows:\n735\t    - - Trained (LIBERO-finetuned)\n736\t      - '0.678'\n737\t      - L13\n738\t      - '0.528'\n739\t      - '0.150'\n740\t      - Yes (> 0.08)\n741\t    - - Untrained (OXE pretrained)\n742\t      - '0.825'\n743\t      - L21\n744\t      - '0.805'\n745\t      - '0.020'\n746\t      - 'No'\n747\t  - title: 'OpenVLA × Goal: L1 Attention & CF'\n748\t    columns:\n749\t    - Condition\n750\t    - L1 Instr-Dom Heads\n751\t    - Text Attn %\n752\t    - CF empty d\n753\t    - CF ordering\n754\t    rows:\n755\t    - - Trained\n756\t      - 24/32\n757\t      - 57.7%\n758\t      - '0.96'\n759\t      - empty > wrong > shuf > para\n760\t    - - Untrained (OXE)\n761\t      - 25/32\n762\t      