{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01Lo66MkaH864HVneifnXVKW","type":"tool_result","content":"1140\t- name: D095 Cross-Architecture Consolidated Matrix Analysis\n1141\t  plan_id: d095_synthesis\n1142\t  description: '汇总全部 3 arch × 4 suite 矩阵数据，计算 aggregate metrics，\n1143\t\n1144\t    验证 best tier key indicators 全部达标。\n1145\t\n1146\t    '\n1147\t  expected_results:\n1148\t    matrix_cells_with_full_data: 10\n1149\t    matrix_total_possible: 12\n1150\t    missing_cells: NORA Object, NORA Long (no finetuned checkpoints)\n1151\t    r2_collapse_confirmed_cells: 9\n1152\t    r2_collapse_rejected_cells: 1\n1153\t    r2_collapse_outlier: OpenVLA Long (OFT, Δ=0.004)\n1154\t    mean_trained_exit_delta: 0.226\n1155\t    median_trained_exit_delta: 0.168\n1156\t    trained_delta_range:\n1157\t    - 0.004\n1158\t    - 0.691\n1159\t    trained_delta_iqr:\n1160\t    - 0.128\n1161\t    - 0.296\n1162\t    mean_untrained_exit_delta: 0.032\n1163\t    cf_sensitivity_ratio_tracvla: 8.1\n1164\t    cf_sensitivity_ratio_nora: 12.3\n1165\t    cf_sensitivity_ratio_overall: 9.5\n1166\t    cf_empty_first_fraction: 11/12 trained settings\n1167\t    cross_arch_r2_peak_layer_std: 2.4\n1168\t    cross_arch_inverted_u_confirmed: 3/3 architectures\n1169\t    cross_arch_exit_collapse_confirmed: 3/3 architectures\n1170\t    openvla_L1_gradient: untrained 0/32 → OXE 25/32 → trained 24/32\n1171\t    tracvla_L1_trained: 27-30/32\n1172\t    tracvla_L1_untrained: 32/32 (Phi-3-Vision pre-existing)\n1173\t    nora_L1_trained: 12-13/16\n1174\t    nora_L1_untrained: 13-14/16 (Qwen2.5-VL pre-existing)\n1175\t    d090_conclusion: L1 is base-model-dependent, NOT training-induced\n1176\t    tier1_signature: no exit collapse, weak CF (cos < 0.2), L1 from LLM pretraining\n1177\t    tier2_signature: no exit collapse, strong CF (d ≈ 1.0), L1 from OXE pretraining\n1178\t    tier3_signature: exit collapse (Δ > 0.08), task-specific CF, L1 ≈ OXE level\n1179\t    expected_reviewer_avg_score:\n1180\t    - 5.5\n1181\t    - 7.0\n1182\t    accept_probability:\n1183\t    - 0.55\n1184\t    - 0.75\n1185\t  result_rationale: '**Matrix completeness (10/12)**: NORA 仅 Goal+Spatial 因为无 Object/Long\n1186\t    finetuned checkpoint\n1187\t\n1188\t    （D089 决定）。10 cells 覆盖 3 architectures × 至少 2 suites，足以 claim cross-architecture\n1189\t\n1190\t    generalization。12 cells 中 10 个 filled = 83% coverage，CoRL standard 下可接受。\n1191\t\n1192\t\n1193\t    **R² exit collapse (9/10 confirmed, mean Δ=0.226)**:\n1194\t\n1195\t    9 cells 确认 trained Δ > 0.08，mean Δ=0.226 落入 best tier [0.2, 0.35] 的下半段。\n1196\t\n1197\t    Median Δ=0.168 更保守但仍远超 untrained mean（0.032）。跨架构一致性：OpenVLA\n1198\t\n1199\t    （Δ=0.12-0.15, Llama-2），TracVLA（Δ=0.14-0.29, Phi-3），NORA（Δ=0.30-0.69, Qwen2.5-VL）。\n1200\t\n1201\t    NORA 最极端可能因 GQA 架构（16h/2kv）导致更尖锐的 routing 重塑。OFT outlier（Δ=0.004）\n1202\t\n1203\t    被 D091 解释为 parameter-efficient finetuning 特例：TracVLA Long trained（full finetuning）\n1204\t\n1205\t    在同一 suite 上 Δ=0.198，证明 Long suite 本身不是问题。\n1206\t\n1207\t\n1208\t    **CF sensitivity ratio (9.5×)**:\n1209\t\n1210\t    跨 VLM-base architectures，trained CF sensitivity / untrained CF sensitivity ≈ 7-12×。\n1211\t\n1212\t    TracVLA mean ratio = (1.52/0.153 + 1.33/0.180 + 1.21/0.185 + 1.47/0.173) / 4 ≈\n1213\t    8.1×。\n1214\t\n1215\t    NORA Goal: 训练后 cosine saturated to 1.0 vs untrained 0.081 → ratio 极端但 metric\n1216\t\n1217\t    ceiling 导致不可比。Excluding NORA saturation，overall ratio ≈ 8-10×，comfortably in [7,\n1218\t    12]。\n1219\t\n1220\t\n1221\t    **Cross-architecture R² peak layer std (2.4)**:\n1222\t\n1223\t    OpenVLA peak L8-L13（center ~L10），TracVLA peak L4-L22（center ~L14），\n1224\t\n1225\t    NORA peak L10。std(10, 14, 10) ≈ 1.9-2.4，在 [1.5, 3.0] 内。Peak layer 跨架构\n1226\t\n1227\t    一致性说明 mid-layer integration 是 architecture-independent phenomenon。\n1228\t\n1229\t\n1230\t    **D090 区分**:\n1231\t\n1232\t    L1 head count 清晰分为两类：(a) Training-induced = 0（TracVLA/NORA untrained 已有\n1233\t\n1234\t    strong L1），(b) Pre-existing = 高（来自 VLM/LLM 预训练）。只有 OpenVLA 的\n1235\t\n1236\t    untrained=random init 显示 L1=0，但这是因为 random init 无任何语言能力。OXE pretrained\n1237\t\n1238\t    OpenVLA 已有 25/32。论文明确 claim：R² exit collapse 和 CF sensitivity 是\n1239\t\n1240\t    architecture-independent training effects，L1 head count 不是。\n1241\t\n1242\t\n1243\t    **三层级梯度**:\n1244\t\n1245\t    Tier 1→2→3 在 exit collapse（无→无→有）、CF sensitivity（弱→强→强+task-specific）、\n1246\t\n1247\t    和 routing pattern（无→通用→task-specific）上形成 monotonic gradient。这不是\n1248\t\n1249\t    binary creation story 而是 progressive emergence + reshaping story——更 nuanced，\n1250\t\n1251\t    更符合 developmental/training dynamics 的实际过程。\n1252\t\n1253\t\n1254\t    **Paper strength assessment**:\n1255\t\n1256\t    三个贡献全部 land：(1) Framework validated on 3×4=10 cells，(2) exit collapse +\n1257\t\n1258\t    CF 作为 architecture-independent signatures 有 9/10 cells 支持，(3) 三层级梯度\n1259\t\n1260\t    是 genuine new finding with clear mechanistic interpretation。D090 区分增强而非\n1261\t\n1262\t    削弱可信度。Expected reviewer score 5.5-7.0 基于：strong methodology (+)，\n1263\t\n1264\t    comprehensive validation (+)，clear narrative (+)，no closed-loop evaluation (-)，\n1265\t\n1266\t    open-loop only (-)，representational analysis 在 robotics venue 的 novelty concern\n1267\t    (-)。\n1268\t\n1269\t    Accept probability 55-75% 考虑了 CoRL 的 acceptance rate (~30%) 和论文的相对强度。\n1270\t\n1271\t    '\n1272\t  tables:\n1273\t  - title: Complete R² Exit Collapse Matrix (Trained Δ = peak − exit)\n1274\t    columns:\n1275\t    - Architecture (Backbone)\n1276\t    - Goal\n1277\t    - Spatial\n1278\t    - Object\n1279\t    - Long\n1280\t    - Mean Δ\n1281\t    rows:\n1282\t    - - OpenVLA (Llama-2-7B, 32L, MHA)\n1283\t      - 0.150 ✓\n1284\t      - 0.130 ✓\n1285\t      - 0.121 ✓\n1286\t      - 0.004 △\n1287\t      - '0.101'\n1288\t    - - TracVLA (Phi-3-mini, 32L, MHA)\n1289\t      - 0.228 ✓\n1290\t      - 0.138 ✓\n1291\t      - 0.294 ✓\n1292\t      - 0.198 ✓\n1293\t      - '0.