{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01WoADziF2MB6dw4T3oHKVnT","type":"tool_result","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Perfect! Now I have a complete picture. Let me compile my findings.\n\n## Complete Experiment Plan Summary\n\nI found the complete experiment plan for the vla-ssd project. Here's the comprehensive list of ALL experiments:\n\n### **Main Experiment Plan File**\n**Location:** `/home/ubuntu/.agent-ml-research-idea_gen_0509_15/projects/vla-ssd/experiment_plan.yaml`\n\nThis file contains 13 core experiments (plan_001 through plan_013), with their statuses as follows:\n\n### **COMPLETED EXPERIMENTS (11 experiments)**\n1. **plan_001** - SigLIP+Projector RSA vs Full VLA vs DINO (Claim 1) - **Status: done**\n2. **plan_002** - DINO baseline RSA (Claim 1) - **Status: done**\n3. **plan_003** - Per-layer RSA curve (Claim 2) - **Status: done**\n4. **plan_004** - Output head analysis (Claim 2) - **Status: done**\n5. **plan_005** - 6 probing methods × 2 benchmarks (Claim 3) - **Status: done**\n6. **plan_006** - Instruction ablation (Claim 3) - **Status: done**\n7. **plan_007** - 2×2 matrix: training × instruction (Claim 3) - **Status: done**\n8. **plan_008** - Random instruction control (Claim 3) - **Status: done**\n9. **plan_009** - CKA verification (Claims 1, 2) - **Status: done**\n10. **plan_011** - Full-layer R² scan (Claims 1, 2, 3) - **Status: done**\n11. **plan_013** - Branch-split RSA (Claim 1) - **Status: done**\n\n### **PLANNED/IN-PROGRESS EXPERIMENTS (2 experiments)**\n1. **plan_010** - LIBERO-Spatial cross-benchmark validation (Claims 1, 2, 3) - **Status: preparing**\n   - Priority: P2\n   - Note: Director approved startup. Data download + disk cleanup in progress.\n\n2. **plan_012** - CLIP-ViT pretraining control (Claims 1, 2) - **Status: done**\n   - Actually completed with results: CLIP RSA=0.557, R²=0.587\n   - Note: Invalidated 'VL pretraining dominance' interpretation\n\n### **ADDITIONAL EXPERIMENTS (from dream reports)**\nThe most recent dream report (`dream_20260522T021705/best/imagined_experiments.yaml`) contains extended experiments:\n\n3. **openvla_goal_standardized_v1** - OpenVLA Goal Standardized Full Pipeline\n   - Tests trained vs OXE-pretrained on LIBERO-Goal\n   - Shows R² exit collapse and three-tier routing gradient\n\n4. **openvla_spatial_standardized_v1** - OpenVLA Spatial Standardized Full Pipeline\n   - Tests trained vs OXE-pretrained on LIBERO-Spatial\n   - Completes 10-cell matrix\n\n5. **cf_batch_missing_v1** - Batch Untrained Counterfactual (Missing Matrix Cells)\n   - Supplements counterfactual analyses\n\n6. **d095_synthesis** - D095 Cross-Architecture Consolidated Matrix Analysis\n   - Comprehensive synthesis across 3 architectures × 4 suites (10 cells total)\n\n### **KEY FINDINGS SUMMARY**\n\n**Three Core Claims:**\n1. **Vision Encoder Dominance**: SigLIP+projector RSA (0.615) >> VLA (0.501) >> DINO (0.388)\n2. **LLM Redistributes Action Structure**: Training-dependent readout concentration but geometric degradation\n3. **Training: Routing Without Creating**: Fine-tuning routes information but doesn't create new action knowledge\n\n**Matrix Status**: 10/12 cells completed across 3 architectures (OpenVLA, TracVLA, NORA) × 4 suites (Goal, Spatial, Object, Long)\n\n**Most Critical File References:**\n- Main plan: `/home/ubuntu/.agent-ml-research-idea_gen_0509_15/projects/vla-ssd/experiment_plan.yaml`\n- Paper framing: `/home/ubuntu/.agent-ml-research-idea_gen_0509_15/projects/vla-ssd/artifacts/dream_reports/dream_20260516T011810/best/paper_framing.md`\n- Latest imagined experiments: `/home/ubuntu/.agent-ml-research-idea_gen_0509_15/projects/vla-ssd/artifacts/dream_reports/dream_20260522T021705/best/imagined_experiments.yaml`"}]}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"26867879-adf3-4c14-9393-b9045e867606","uuid":"ecfbe6b5-476f-44e2-a8f3-67d6c2439a4b","timestamp":"2026-05-27T02:35:08.486Z","tool_use_result":{"status":"completed","prompt":"In /home/ubun