{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01H2Frmv5LhsGXZwekTcW9Me","type":"tool_result","content":"1\ttier: median\n2\tnarrative_guidance: 'Median 档下，R² exit collapse 在 8/10 cells 确认但 OpenVLA 有 2 个弱 cell（Long\n3\t  OFT + Spatial）， 削弱 \"architecture-independent\" 的绝对性，需降为 \"consistent across three\n4\t  tested architectures with caveats\"。D090 区分（training-induced vs base-model-dependent）成为双刃剑：区分本身是\n5\t  honest science，但 reviewers 会追问 \"如果 L1 heads 来自预训练，training 到底贡献了什么？\"。 三层级梯度仅 1 个\n6\t  Tier-2 数据点（OXE openvla-7b），被降为 suggestive observation。 CF sensitivity ratio 被 OpenVLA\n7\t  OXE baseline 的高 CF 拉低（OXE 本身 d≈1.0， 训练后仅 d≈1.15，ratio 仅 1.1×），与 TracVLA 10× 形成鲜明对比，\n8\t  暴露 \"cross-architecture CF ratio\" 实际是 \"cross-baseline CF ratio\" 问题。 NORA 仅 2/4 suites\n9\t  被视为 incomplete。C3 移入 appendix。 需要 1 个轻量 additional analysis 补偿 contribution density，\n10\t  推荐 exit-collapse-rate analysis（无新 GPU 成本，用已有 R² profiles 计算 exit 层衰减斜率）。 仍可 accept\n11\t  但需要 reviewer champion，accept probability ≈ 0.35。\n12\t\n13\t  '\n14\timagined_experiments:\n15\t- name: openvla_goal_standardized_v1\n16\t  plan_id: N/A — registry-level, fills OpenVLA × Goal cell in 3×4 matrix\n17\t  description: 'OpenVLA (Llama-2-7B) on LIBERO-Goal 的标准化 5-phase pipeline： R² probing、L1\n18\t    attention、cross-instruction classification、RSA、counterfactual。 Trained = openvla-7b-finetuned-libero-goal，Untrained\n19\t    = openvla-7b (OXE pretrained, Tier-2)。 10 tasks × 10 demos × 50 timesteps。 Median\n20\t    档预测：确认 R² exit collapse（Δ=0.141），但 CF ratio 偏低（1.12×） 因 OXE baseline 本身已有强 CF\n21\t    sensitivity。\n22\t\n23\t    '\n24\t  expected_results:\n25\t    trained_r2_last_preaction:\n26\t      L0: 0.561\n27\t      L4: 0.638\n28\t      L8: 0.659\n29\t      L12: 0.672\n30\t      L16: 0.651\n31\t      L20: 0.623\n32\t      L24: 0.589\n33\t      L28: 0.556\n34\t      L31: 0.531\n35\t      peak_layer: 12\n36\t      peak_r2: 0.672\n37\t      exit_r2: 0.531\n38\t      delta_peak_exit: 0.141\n39\t    trained_r2_image_mean:\n40\t      L0: 0.636\n41\t      L4: 0.647\n42\t      L8: 0.658\n43\t      L10: 0.661\n44\t      L12: 0.655\n45\t      L16: 0.639\n46\t      L20: 0.612\n47\t      L24: 0.594\n48\t      L28: 0.587\n49\t      L31: 0.578\n50\t      peak_layer: 10\n51\t      peak_r2: 0.661\n52\t    untrained_r2_last_preaction:\n53\t      L0: 0.608\n54\t      L4: 0.776\n55\t      L8: 0.795\n56\t      L12: 0.807\n57\t      L16: 0.812\n58\t      L20: 0.819\n59\t      L21: 0.822\n60\t      L24: 0.818\n61\t      L28: 0.813\n62\t      L31: 0.808\n63\t      peak_layer: 21\n64\t      peak_r2: 0.822\n65\t      exit_r2: 0.808\n66\t      delta_peak_exit: 0.014\n67\t    untrained_r2_image_mean:\n68\t      L0: 0.826\n69\t      L4: 0.833\n70\t      L8: 0.837\n71\t      L12: 0.846\n72\t      L16: 0.843\n73\t      L20: 0.838\n74\t      L24: 0.839\n75\t      L28: 0.841\n76\t      L31: 0.836\n77\t      peak_layer: 12\n78\t      peak_r2: 0.846\n79\t    trained_l1_attention:\n80\t      instruction_dominant: 24\n81\t      mixed: 4\n82\t      image_dominant: 4\n83\t      total_heads: 32\n84\t      mean_text_attn: 0.571\n85\t      mean_image_attn: 0.218\n86\t    untrained_l1_attention:\n87\t      instruction_dominant: 25\n88\t      mixed: 7\n89\t      image_dominant: 0\n90\t      total_heads: 32\n91\t      mean_text_attn: 0.672\n92\t      mean_image_attn: 0.221\n93\t    trained_cross_instruction:\n94\t      image_mean_all_layers: 0.1\n95\t      last_preaction_L0: 0.1\n96\t      last_preaction_L1: 0.997\n97\t      last_preaction_L2_plus: 1.0\n98\t    untrained_cross_instruction:\n99\t      image_mean_all_layers: 0.1\n100\t      last_preaction_all_layers: 1.0\n101\t      note: OXE model maintains 100% classification accuracy at all layers — no deep-layer\n102\t        degradation\n103\t    trained_counterfactual:\n104\t      empty_d: 1.15\n105\t      wrong_d: 0.93\n106\t      shuffled_d: 0.72\n107\t      paraphrased_d: 0.62\n108\t      ranking: empty > wrong > shuffled > paraphrased\n109\t    untrained_counterfactual:\n110\t      empty_d: 1.03\n111\t      wrong_d: 0.82\n112\t      shuffled_d: 0.61\n113\t      paraphrased_d: 0.59\n114\t      ranking: empty > wrong > shuffled > paraphrased\n115\t    cf_ratio_empty: 1.12\n116\t    trained_rsa_peak:\n117\t      layer: 12\n118\t      rsa: 0.497\n119\t    untrained_rsa_peak:\n120\t      layer: 12\n121\t      rsa: 0.518\n122\t    r2_exit_collapse_confirmed: true\n123\t    training_induced: true\n124\t    delta_trained_vs_untrained: 0.127\n125\t  result_rationale: 'Goal 确认 collapse 的逻辑：（1）LIBERO-Goal 任务需要 instruction routing\n126\t    来识别 目标物体（\"pick up the red mug\" vs \"pick up the blue cup\"），训练将这种 routing 从 OXE\n127\t    的 diffuse mid-layer 模式重组为 entry-exit bookend 模式； （2）R² exit collapse（Δ=0.141）的量级与\n128\t    OpenVLA Object（Δ=0.121）一致， 表明 Goal/Object 类任务在 OpenVLA 上稳定产生 training-induced\n129\t    collapse； （3）但 CF ratio 仅 1.12×（trained d=1.15 / OXE d=1.03），远低于 TracVLA 10×，\n130\t    因为 OXE 在 970K diverse episodes 上已建立强 instruction sensitivity—— LIBERO fine-tuning\n131\t    只做边际提升，而非从零创建； （4）L1 heads 几乎不变（trained 24 vs OXE 25），进一步确认 D090： L1 routing 是\n132\t    base-model 继承的，不是 LIBERO 训练创造的； （5）Untrained R² profile 极其平坦（Δ=0.014），与 Long untrained（Δ=0.016）一致，\n133\t    说明 OXE 预训练创造的是均匀的 representation preservation，而非 exit collapse。 OXE model cross-instruction\n134\t    全层 100% 也表明 Tier-2 已有完善的 language routing。\n135\t\n136\t    '\n137\t  tables:\n138\t  - title: OpenVLA Goal R² Exit Collapse Comparison\n139\t    columns:\n140\t    - Condition\n141\t    - Peak Layer\n142\t    - Peak R²\n143\t    - Exit R² (L31)\n144\t    - Δ(peak−exit)\n145\t    - Collapse?\n146\t    rows:\n147\t    - - Trained (LIBERO-Goal)\n148\t      - L12\n149\t      - '0.672'\n150\t      - '0.531'\n151\t      - '0.141'\n152\t      - ✓\n153\t    - - Untrained (OXE)\n154\t      - L21\n155\t      - '0.822'\n156\t      - '0.808'\n157\t      - '0.014'\n158\t      - ✗\n159\t  - title: OpenVLA Goal L1 Attention Comparison\n160\t    columns:\n161\t    - Metric\n162\t    - Trained\n163\t    - Untrained (OXE)\n164\t    - Δ\n165\t    rows:\n166\t    - - Instruction-dominant heads\n167\t      - 24/32\n168\t      - 25/32\n169\t      - '-1'\n170\t    - - Mean text attention\n171\t      - '0.571'\n172\t      - '0.672'\n173\t      - '-0.101'\n174\t    - - Mean image attention\n175\t      - '0.218'\n176\t      - '0.221'\n177\t      - '-0.003'\n178\t  - title: OpenVLA Goal CF Sensitivity\n179\t    columns:\n180\t    - Condition\n181\t    - Empty d\n182\t    - Wrong d\n183\t    - Shuffled d\n184\t    - Para d\n185\t    rows:\n186\t    - - Trained\n187\t      - '1.15'\n188\t      - '0.93'\n189\t      - '0.72'\n190\t      - '0.62'\n191\t    - - Untrained (OXE)\n192\t      - '1.03'\n193\t      - '0.82'\n194\t      - '0.61'\n195\t      - '0.59'\n196\t    - - Ratio\n197\t      - 1.12×\n198\t      - 1.13×\n199\t      - 1.18×\n200\t      - 1.05×\n201\t  figures_description:\n202\t  - 'R² per-layer profile (last_preaction): trained 显示经典 inverted-U（peak L12=0.672）\n203\t    并在 exit 层急剧下降至 0.531；OXE untrained 为近乎平坦曲线（0.78-0.82）， 两条线在 L0-L4 和 L28-L31 区间交叉，中间层\n204\t    trained 高于 untrained。 明确标注 Δ(peak-exit) = 0.141 vs 0.014。\n205\t\n206\t    '\n207\t  - 'L1 attention heatmap：两条件几乎相同（24 vs 25 instruction-dominant heads）， 视觉上突出 D090\n208\t    finding——L1 routing 来自 OXE 预训练而非 LIBERO fine-tuning。\n209\t\n210\t    '\n211\t  analysis: 'Goal cell 成功确认 R² exit collapse 的 training-induced 性质。 但该 cell 同时暴露 OpenVLA\n212\t    特有问题：OXE untrained baseline 极强 （R² flat ~0.82, CF d≈1.0, L1 25/32 heads, cross-instruction\n213\t    100%）， 导致 trained-untrained 对比的 margin 远小于 TracVLA/NORA（Tier-3 vs Tier-1）。 这使得\n214\t    \"cross-architecture CF ratio\" 实际上是 \"cross-baseline sensitivity ratio\"， 需要在论文中显式说明。对\n215\t    reviewer 而言，Goal 的 R² collapse 是干净的， 但 CF 和 L1 数据不提供额外支持。\n216\t\n217\t    '\n218\t- name: openvla_spatial_standardized_v1\n219\t  plan_id: N/A — registry-level, fills OpenVLA × Spatial cell in 3×4 matrix\n220\t  description: 'OpenVLA on LIBERO-Spatial 的标准化 5-phase pipeline。 Median 档预测：R² exit\n221\t    collapse 偏弱（Δ=0.037 < 0.05），成为第二个弱 cell （与 Long OFT 并列）。成因不同于 OFT：Spatial 任务的\n222\t    instruction routing 需求 较低（空间关系主要由视觉编码器处理），加上 OXE pretraining 已涵盖大量 spatial manipulation\n223\t    数据，LIBERO Spatial 的边际贡献极小。\n224\t\n225\t    '\n226\t  expected_results:\n227\t    trained_r2_last_preaction:\n228\t      L0: 0.558\n229\t      L4: 0.641\n230\t      L8: 0.668\n231\t      L12: 0.674\n232\t      L14: 0.679\n233\t      L16: 0.672\n234\t      L20: 0.657\n235\t      L24: 0.649\n236\t      L28: 0.645\n237\t      L31: 0.642\n238\t      peak_layer: 14\n239\t      peak_r2: 0.679\n240\t      exit_r2: 0.642\n241\t      delta_peak_exit: 0.037\n242\t    trained_r2_image_mean:\n243\t      L0: 0.642\n244\t      L4: 0.651\n245\t      L8: 0.665\n246\t      L11: 0.67\n247\t      L12: 0.669\n248\t      L16: 0.651\n249\t      L20: 0.634\n250\t      L24: 0.622\n251\t      L28: 0.618\n252\t      L31: 0.612\n253\t      peak_layer: 11\n254\t      peak_r2: 0.67\n255\t    untrained_r2_last_preaction:\n256\t      L0: 0.611\n257\t      L4: 0.779\n258\t      L8: 0.798\n259\t      L12: 0.811\n260\t      L16: 0.816\n261\t      L20: 0.821\n262\t      L22: 0.824\n263\t      L24: 0.82\n264\t      L28: 0.815\n265\t      L31: 0.811\n266\t      peak_layer: 22\n267\t      peak_r2: 0.824\n268\t      exit_r2: 0.811\n269\t      delta_peak_exit: 0.013\n270\t    untrained_r2_image_mean:\n271\t      L0: 0.828\n272\t      L4: 0.835\n273\t      L8: 0.84\n274\t      L12: 0.849\n275\t      L16: 0.845\n276\t      L20: 0.84\n277\t      L24: 0.841\n278\t      L28: 0.843\n279\t      L31: 0.838\n280\t      peak_layer: 12\n281\t      peak_r2: 0.849\n282\t    trained_l1_attention:\n283\t      instruction_dominant: 22\n284\t      mixed: 5\n285\t      image_dominant: 5\n286\t      total_heads: 32\n287\t      mean_text_attn: 0.527\n288\t      mean_image_attn: 0.258\n289\t    untrained_l1_attention:\n290\t      instruction_dominant: 25\n291\t      mixed: 7\n292\t      image_dominant: 0\n293\t      total_heads: 32\n294\t      mean_text_attn: 0.668\n295\t      mean_image_attn: 0.225\n296\t    trained_cross_instruction:\n297\t      image_mean_all_layers: 0.1\n298\t      last_preaction_L0: 0.1\n299\t      last_preaction_L1: 0.989\n300\t      last_preaction_L2_plus: 1.0\n301\t    untrained_cross_instruction:\n302\t      last_preaction_all_layers: 1.0\n303\t    trained_counterfactual:\n304\t      empty_d: 0.82\n305\t      wrong_d: 0.68\n306\t      shuffled_d: 0.56\n307\t      paraphrased_d: 0.49\n308\t    untrained_counterfactual:\n309\t      empty_d: 1.01\n310\t      wrong_d: 0.8\n311\t      shuffled_d: 0.59\n312\t      paraphrased_d: 0.57\n313\t    cf_ratio_empty: 0.81\n314\t    cf_ratio_note: Trained CF LOWER than untrained — OXE 的 spatial 泛化能力被 LIBERO fine-tuning\n315\t      部分覆写\n316\t    trained_rsa_peak:\n317\t      layer: 14\n318\t      rsa: 0.502\n319\t    untrained_rsa_peak:\n320\t      layer: 12\n321\t      rsa: 0.521\n322\t    r2_exit_collapse_confirmed: false\n323\t    training_induced: weak\n324\t    delta_trained_vs_untrained: 0.024\n325\t    verdict: △ — Δ=0.037 存在但 < 0.05 threshold; trained CF 低于 untrained\n326\t  result_rationale: 'Spatial 弱效应的三层原因： （1）Task 特性：LIBERO-Spatial 的 instruction 主要指定空间关系（\"put\n327\t    X on the left of Y\"），routing 需求集中在 spatial parsing 而非 goal identification。 Vision\n328\t    encoder + OXE pretraining 已提供充分的 spatial representation， LIBERO fine-tuning 对\n329\t    instruction routing 的边际改造极小。 （2）OXE coverage：Open X-Embodiment 970K episodes 包含大量\n330\t    kitchen/tabletop spatial manipulation 任务（Bridge, RT-1, TOTO 等），OXE pretrained\n331\t    model 已经在 spatial reasoning 上饱和——不像 Goal 任务中存在特异性目标物体需要额外学习。 （3）R² profile 解读：trained\n332\t    last_preaction 呈现 shallow inverted-U （peak L14=0.679, exit L31=0.642, Δ=0.037），相比\n333\t    Goal（Δ=0.141） 衰减幅度小 3.8×。exit layer 仍保留较高 R²（0.642 vs Goal 的 0.531）， 说明训练未充分 \"collapse\"\n334\t    exit 层信息。 CF ratio < 1（trained 0.82 < untrained 1.01）是最具挑战性的结果： 意味着 LIBERO Spatial\n335\t    fine-tuning 反而降低了整体 instruction sensitivity。 解读：OXE 的 generalist sensitivity 被\n336\t    specialist fine-tuning 部分覆写为 task-specific pattern，总量下降但方向性更强（更 task-aligned 而非更\n337\t    sensitive）。 Reviewer 会质疑：\"如果训练降低 CF sensitivity，你怎么能 claim training improves routing？\"\n338\t    回应需要精细区分 sensitivity 和 specificity。\n339\t\n340\t    '\n341\t  tables:\n342\t  - title: OpenVLA Spatial R² Exit Collapse Comparison\n343\t    columns:\n344\t    - Condition\n345\t    - Peak Layer\n346\t    - Peak R²\n347\t    - Exit R² (L31)\n348\t    - Δ(peak−exit)\n349\t    - Collapse?\n350\t    rows:\n351\t    - - Trained (LIBERO-Spatial)\n352\t      - L14\n353\t      - '0.679'\n354\t      - '0.642'\n355\t      - '0.037'\n356\t      - △ weak\n357\t    - - Untrained (OXE)\n358\t      - L22\n359\t      - '0.824'\n360\t      - '0.811'\n361\t      - '0.013'\n362\t      - ✗\n363\t  - title: OpenVLA Spatial CF Sensitivity — Trained LOWER than Untrained\n364\t    columns:\n365\t    - Condition\n366\t    - Empty d\n367\t    - Wrong d\n368\t    - Shuffled d\n369\t    - Para d\n370\t    rows:\n371\t    - - Trained\n372\t      - '0.82'\n373\t      - '0.68'\n374\t      - '0.56'\n375\t      - '0.49'\n376\t    - - Untrained (OXE)\n377\t      - '1.01'\n378\t      - '0.80'\n379\t      - '0.59'\n380\t      - '0.57'\n381\t    - - Ratio (T/U)\n382\t      - 0.81×\n383\t      - 0.85×\n384\t      - 0.95×\n385\t      - 0.86×\n386\t  - title: OpenVLA 4-Suite Summary — 2 strong, 2 weak\n387\t    columns:\n388\t    - Suite\n389\t    - Trained Δ(peak−exit)\n390\t    - CF Ratio\n391\t    - Collapse?\n392\t    - Issue\n393\t    rows:\n394\t    - - Object\n395\t      - '0.121'\n396\t      - ~2×\n397\t      - ✓\n398\t      - —\n399\t    - - Goal\n400\t      - '0.141'\n401\t      - 1.12×\n402\t      - ✓\n403\t      - CF ratio low\n404\t    - - Spatial\n405\t      - '0.037'\n406\t      - 0.81×\n407\t      - △\n408\t      - Δ < 0.05, CF inverted\n409\t    - - Long (OFT)\n410\t      - '0.004'\n411\t      - ~1×\n412\t      - △\n413\t      - OFT training confound\n414\t  figures_description:\n415\t  - 'R² last_preaction 4-suite overlay for OpenVLA trained：Object (Δ=0.121) 和 Goal\n416\t    (Δ=0.141) 展示清晰 exit collapse；Spatial (Δ=0.037) 呈 shallow decline； Long OFT (Δ=0.004)\n417\t    几乎平坦。形成从强到弱的连续谱系， 标注 Δ < 0.05 threshold line。\n418\t\n419\t    '\n420\t  - 'Trained vs Untrained CF d scatter plot：x=untrained d, y=trained d, 点标注 suite\n421\t    name。Goal 在 y=x 线略上方，Spatial 在线下方（唯一反转 cell）， Long 接近对角线。对角线上方 = training increases\n422\t    CF，下方 = training decreases CF。\n423\t\n424\t    '\n425\t  analysis: 'Spatial 弱 cell 与 Long OFT 弱 cell 的成因不同： OFT 是因为 parameter-efficient fine-tuning\n426\t    限制了权重变化幅度（frozen majority weights）， Spatial 是因为 OXE pretraining 已充分覆盖了 spatial\n427\t    reasoning task space。 两者共同削弱 \"architecture-independent\" 的绝对性，但方式互补： OFT 说明 training\n428\t    method matters，Spatial 说明 pretraining coverage matters。 论文需要承认这些 nuances 并将 claim\n429\t    降为 \"consistent across three tested architectures in 8/10 cells, with two exceptions\n430\t    attributable to specific training configurations\"。 对 acceptance 的影响：Spatial 的\n431\t    CF inversion 是最 damaging 的数据点， reviewer 可以用它论证 \"training does not consistently\n432\t    enhance instruction routing\"。 反驳策略：强调 R² collapse 是 robust metric（8/10 cells），CF\n433\t    是 secondary indicator 且受 baseline strength 影响，Spatial 的 inverted CF 恰恰说明 specialist\n434\t    fine-tuning trades breadth for depth。\n435\t\n436\t    '\n437\t- name: cf_batch_missing_v1\n438\t  plan_id: N/A — registry-level batch job filling 5 missing untrained CF cells\n439\t  description: '批量补跑 5 个 untrained counterfactual cells，使用 cosine_dist 方法 （untrained\n440\t    VLM/VLA 的 hidden representation cosine distance，非 action-space d）。 条件：OpenVLA\n441\t    Object untrained (OXE), TracVLA Spatial/Object/Goal/Long untrained (Phi-3-Vision)。\n442\t    已完成执行，进入 ANALYZING 状态。 Median 档预测：所有 5 条件成功产出，但 OpenVLA untrained (OXE) 与 TracVLA\n443\t    untrained (Phi-3 base) 的 cos_dist 量级差异大（OXE >> Phi-3），暴露跨架构对比的 baseline 不均。\n444\t\n445\t    '\n446\t  expected_results:\n447\t    openvla_object_untrained:\n448\t      method: cosine_dist_L31\n449\t      empty:\n450\t        cos_dist: 0.238\n451\t        cohens_d: 12.4\n452\t      wrong:\n453\t        cos_dist: 0.231\n454\t        cohens_d: 8.7\n455\t      shuffled:\n456\t        cos_dist: 0.189\n457\t        cohens_d: 7.2\n458\t      paraphrased:\n459\t        cos_dist: 0.073\n460\t        cohens_d: 5.1\n461\t      ordering: empty ≈ wrong >> shuffled >> paraphrased\n462\t      note: OXE model cos_dist 远高于 Phi-3 base — OXE 的 instruction sensitivity 强\n463\t    tracvla_spatial_untrained:\n464\t      method: cosine_dist_L31\n465\t      empty:\n466\t        cos_dist: 0.142\n467\t        cohens_d: 9.8\n468\t      wrong:\n469\t        cos_dist: 0.018\n470\t        cohens_d: 1.6\n471\t      shuffled:\n472\t        cos_dist: 0.091\n473\t        cohens_d: 1.9\n474\t      paraphrased:\n475\t        cos_dist: 0.005\n476\t        cohens_d: 1.8\n477\t      ordering: empty >> shuffled > wrong > paraphrased\n478\t    tracvla_object_untrained:\n479\t      method: cosine_dist_L31\n480\t      empty:\n481\t        cos_dist: 0.151\n482\t        cohens_d: 10.1\n483\t      wrong:\n484\t        cos_dist: 0.019\n485\t        cohens_d: 1.7\n486\t      shuffled:\n487\t        cos_dist: 0.097\n488\t        cohens_d: 2.0\n489\t      paraphrased:\n490\t        cos_dist: 0.005\n491\t        cohens_d: 1.9\n492\t      ordering: empty >> shuffled > wrong ≈ paraphrased\n493\t    tracvla_goal_untrained:\n494\t      method: cosine_dist_L31\n495\t      empty:\n496\t        cos_dist: 0.148\n497\t        cohens_d: 9.5\n498\t      wrong:\n499\t        cos_dist: 0.017\n500\t        cohens_d: 1.4\n501\t      shuffled:\n502\t        cos_dist: 0.085\n503\t        cohens_d: 1.5\n504\t      paraphrased:\n505\t        cos_dist: 0.004\n506\t        cohens_d: 1.7\n507\t      ordering: empty >> shuffled > wrong > paraphrased\n508\t    tracvla_long_untrained:\n509\t      method: cosine_dist_L31\n510\t      empty:\n511\t        cos_dist: 0.168\n512\t        cohens_d: 11.0\n513\t      wrong:\n514\t        cos_dist: 0.022\n515\t        cohens_d: 1.8\n516\t      shuffled:\n517\t        cos_dist: 0.116\n518\t        cohens_d: 2.1\n519\t      paraphrased:\n520\t        cos_dist: 0.007\n521\t        cohens_d: 1.7\n522\t      ordering: empty >> shuffled > wrong > paraphrased\n523\t    cross_condition_pattern: 'Universal ordering for Phi-3 base: empty >> shuffled\n524\t      > {wrong, para}。 Structural perturbation (empty = remove all tokens) > reordering\n525\t      (shuffled) > semantic (wrong, para)。 与 trained CF ordering (empty > wrong >\n526\t      shuffled > para) 不同 — training reshapes ordering from structural-dominance to\n527\t      semantic-sensitivity。 OXE untrained ordering closer to trained pattern (empty\n528\t      ≈ wrong >> shuffled) because OXE already has semantic routing。\n529\t\n530\t      '\n531\t    matrix_completeness_after:\n532\t      total_cf_cells: 20\n533\t      filled_before: 14\n534\t      filled_after: 19\n535\t      still_missing: NORA Spatial untrained CF (potentially in nora_spatial_pipeline_v2)\n536\t  result_rationale: '（1）Phi-3-Vision base (TracVLA untrained) 的 cos_dist 模式一致且量级偏低\n537\t    （empty cos_dist 0.14-0.17，wrong/para 仅 0.005-0.022），因为 Phi-3 base 是纯 VLM， instruction\n538\t    虽被 attend to（L1 32/32 heads）但不 condition action-relevant computation （无 action\n539\t    training），perturbation 仅引起浅层 representation shift。 Empty 的 cos_dist 远超其他条件（10-30×）是因为\n540\t    empty = 完全移除 instruction tokens 改变了 sequence structure，产生 structural 而非 semantic\n541\t    的 representation change。 （2）OXE untrained 的 cos_dist 显著更高（wrong=0.231 vs Phi-3\n542\t    0.017-0.022）， 因为 OXE 模型经过 action training，instruction perturbation 通过 routing\n543\t    mechanism 传导到 deeper representation layers，产生更大的 hidden state 偏移。 这进一步佐证 Tier-2\n544\t    vs Tier-1 的区别。 （3）Ordering 差异（Phi-3: empty >> shuffled > wrong vs OXE: empty ≈\n545\t    wrong >> shuffled） 反映 training 如何 reshape sensitivity：untrained VLM 对 structural\n546\t    perturbation 最敏感 （因为没有 learned semantic routing），trained VLA 对 semantic perturbation\n547\t    更敏感 （因为 learned instruction-conditioned routing 依赖 semantic content）。 （4）对 median\n548\t    档的影响：这批数据完成后 CF matrix 从 14/20 → 19/20 cells， 大幅提升 completeness，但同时暴露了 OXE vs\n549\t    Phi-3 baseline 的巨大量级差异， 使得 \"cross-architecture CF comparison\" 需要 careful normalization\n550\t    或 separate discussion。\n551\t\n552\t    '\n553\t  tables:\n554\t  - title: Untrained CF Cosine Distance Summary (cf_batch_missing)\n555\t    columns:\n556\t    - Architecture\n557\t    - Suite\n558\t    - Empty cos\n559\t    - Wrong cos\n560\t    - Shuffled cos\n561\t    - Para cos\n562\t    rows:\n563\t    - - OpenVLA (OXE)\n564\t      - Object\n565\t      - '0.238'\n566\t      - '0.231'\n567\t      - '0.189'\n568\t      - '0.073'\n569\t    - - TracVLA (Phi-3)\n570\t      - Spatial\n571\t      - '0.142'\n572\t      - '0.018'\n573\t      - '0.091'\n574\t      - '0.005'\n575\t    - - TracVLA (Phi-3)\n576\t      - Object\n577\t      - '0.151'\n578\t      - '0.019'\n579\t      - '0.097'\n580\t      - '0.005'\n581\t    - - TracVLA (Phi-3)\n582\t      - Goal\n583\t      - '0.148'\n584\t      - '0.017'\n585\t      - '0.085'\n586\t      - '0.004'\n587\t    - - TracVLA (Phi-3)\n588\t      - Long\n589\t      - '0.168'\n590\t      - '0.022'\n591\t      - '0.116'\n592\t      - '0.007'\n593\t  - title: 'CF Ordering Comparison: VLM Base vs OXE vs Trained'\n594\t    columns:\n595\t    - Condition Type\n596\t    - CF Ordering\n597\t    - Interpretation\n598\t    rows:\n599\t    - - VLM base (Phi-3/Qwen2.5)\n600\t      - empty >> shuffled > wrong ≈ para\n601\t      - Structural sensitivity dominant\n602\t    - - OXE pretrained\n603\t      - empty ≈ wrong >> shuffled > para\n604\t      - Emerging semantic sensitivity\n605\t    - - Task-finetuned (trained)\n606\t      - empty > wrong > shuffled > para\n607\t      - Full semantic sensitivity\n608\t  figures_description:\n609\t  - 'Grouped bar chart: 5 conditions × 4 perturbation types，y-axis = cos_dist（log\n610\t    scale）。 OpenVLA OXE bars 明显高于 TracVLA Phi-3 bars，empty bars 在所有条件中最高。 颜色编码 Tier-1\n611\t    (Phi-3) vs Tier-2 (OXE) 以突出 baseline asymmetry。\n612\t\n613\t    '\n614\t  analysis: 'cf_batch_missing 完成后，CF matrix 接近完整（19/20 cells），但暴露的 baseline asymmetry\n615\t    是双刃剑：一方面证明 Tier-2 (OXE) 已有比 Tier-1 (Phi-3) 更强的 instruction sensitivity（佐证三层级梯度），另一方面使得\n616\t    cross-architecture CF ratio comparison 需要 caveat（不同 baseline 的 ratio 不可直接比较）。\n617\t    论文策略：在 cross-arch CF table 中分开报告 Tier-1 和 Tier-2 baseline 的 ratio， 不做 aggregate\n618\t    \"4-8× cross-architecture average\"。\n619\t\n620\t    '\n621\t- name: exit_collapse_rate_analysis\n622\t  plan_id: N/A — narrative-suggested lightweight additional analysis (no new GPU cost)\n623\t  description: '使用已有 R² profiles 计算每个 matrix cell 的 exit-layer R² 衰减斜率 （last 5 layers\n624\t    linear regression slope），量化 \"exit collapse\" 的 sharpness 作为 training-induced signature。无需新\n625\t    GPU 计算，仅对已有 33-layer R² data 做回归分析。 目的：增强 contribution density，提供除 Δ(peak-exit)\n626\t    之外的第二个 exit collapse 量化指标。\n627\t\n628\t    '\n629\t  expected_results:\n630\t    trained_exit_slopes:\n631\t      openvla_object: -0.024\n632\t      openvla_goal: -0.028\n633\t      openvla_spatial: -0.007\n634\t      openvla_long_oft: -0.001\n635\t      tracvla_goal: -0.058\n636\t      tracvla_spatial: -0.031\n637\t      tracvla_object: -0.047\n638\t      tracvla_long: -0.036\n639\t      nora_goal: -0.139\n640\t      nora_spatial: -0.061\n641\t      mean_confirmed: -0.053\n642\t      mean_all: -0.043\n643\t    untrained_exit_slopes:\n644\t      openvla_oxe: -0.003\n645\t      tracvla_phi3_goal: -0.008\n646\t      tracvla_phi3_spatial: -0.006\n647\t      tracvla_phi3_object: -0.005\n648\t      tracvla_phi3_long: -0.009\n649\t      nora_qwen_goal: -0.007\n650\t      nora_qwen_spatial: -0.005\n651\t      mean: -0.006\n652\t    slope_ratio_trained_vs_untrained: 7.2\n653\t    wilcoxon_p: 0.002\n654\t    effect_size_r: 0.81\n655\t    cross_arch_slope_consistency:\n656\t      openvla_mean_trained: -0.015\n657\t      tracvla_mean_trained: -0.043\n658\t      nora_mean_trained: -0.1\n659\t      note: NORA shows steepest collapse (36 layers, more exit layers); TracVLA intermediate;\n660\t        OpenVLA shallowest\n661\t  result_rationale: 'Exit collapse rate 作为补充指标的逻辑： （1）Δ(peak-exit) 是 coarse binary\n662\t    metric（阈值 0.05），slope 是 continuous measure， 能区分 \"gradual decline\" vs \"sharp cliff\"\n663\t    — 对 Spatial（shallow decline）和 Goal（steep cliff）的区分更精细。 （2）所有 trained models 的\n664\t    slope 显著负于 untrained（Wilcoxon p=0.002）， 即使包含 2 个弱 cell，表明 exit collapse 作为 population-level\n665\t    effect 是 robust 的—— 个别 cell 弱不等于效应不存在。 （3）NORA 的极端 slope（-0.139）反映其 36 层架构在 exit\n666\t    region 有更多层参与 collapse， 可能与 GQA (16h/2kv) 的 compressed attention 有关。 （4）OpenVLA\n667\t    平均 slope 最浅（-0.015），与其 OXE pretrained baseline 的 \"partial training already\" 状态一致——LIBERO\n668\t    fine-tuning 只做 incremental collapse。 （5）这个 analysis 不构成 new finding，但作为 supplementary\n669\t    evidence 增强 \"exit collapse is training-induced\" 的统计支持，并提供 per-architecture 的 slope\n670\t    作为 future work 的 benchmark。\n671\t\n672\t    '\n673\t  tables:\n674\t  - title: 'Exit Collapse Rate: Trained vs Untrained (last 5 layers R² slope)'\n675\t    columns:\n676\t    - Architecture\n677\t    - Suite\n678\t    - Trained Slope\n679\t    - Untrained Slope\n680\t    - Ratio\n681\t    rows:\n682\t    - - OpenVLA\n683\t      - Object\n684\t      - '-0.024'\n685\t      - '-0.003'\n686\t      - 8.0×\n687\t    - - OpenVLA\n688\t      - Goal\n689\t      - '-0.028'\n690\t      - '-0.003'\n691\t      - 9.3×\n692\t    - - OpenVLA\n693\t      - Spatial\n694\t      - '-0.007'\n695\t      - '-0.003'\n696\t      - 2.3×\n697\t    - - OpenVLA\n698\t      - Long (OFT)\n699\t      - '-0.001'\n700\t      - '-0.003'\n701\t      - 0.3×\n702\t    - - TracVLA\n703\t      - Goal\n704\t      - '-0.058'\n705\t      - '-0.008'\n706\t      - 7.3×\n707\t    - - TracVLA\n708\t      - Spatial\n709\t      - '-0.031'\n710\t      - '-0.006'\n711\t      - 5.2×\n712\t    - - TracVLA\n713\t      - Object\n714\t      - '-0.047'\n715\t      - '-0.005'\n716\t      - 9.4×\n717\t    - - TracVLA\n718\t      - Long\n719\t      - '-0.036'\n720\t      - '-0.009'\n721\t      - 4.0×\n722\t    - - NORA\n723\t      - Goal\n724\t      - '-0.139'\n725\t      - '-0.007'\n726\t      - 19.9×\n727\t    - - NORA\n728\t      - Spatial\n729\t      - '-0.061'\n730\t      - '-0.005'\n731\t      - 12.2×\n732\t  - title: Per-Architecture Average Exit Slope\n733\t    columns:\n734\t    - Architecture\n735\t    - Trained Mean Slope\n736\t    - Untrained Mean Slope\n737\t    - n Cells\n738\t    rows:\n739\t    - - OpenVLA (Llama-2-7B)\n740\t      - '-0.015'\n741\t      - '-0.003'\n742\t      - '4'\n743\t    - - TracVLA (Phi-3-mini)\n744\t      - '-0.043'\n745\t      - '-0.007'\n746\t      - '4'\n747\t    - - NORA (Qwen2.5-VL-3B)\n748\t      - '-0.100'\n749\t      - '-0.006'\n750\t      - '2'\n751\t  figures_description:\n752\t  - 'Paired dot plot: 每个 matrix cell 一对点（trained slope vs untrained slope）， connected\n753\t    by line。x-axis = cell identity (grouped by architecture)，y-axis = slope。 Trained\n754\t    dots 系统性低于 untrained dots（除 OFT Long 反转）。 添加 Wilcoxon p=0.002 annotation 和 overall\n755\t    effect size r=0.81。\n756\t\n757\t    '\n758\t  - 'Per-architecture bar chart: 3 architectures，stacked showing trained vs untrained\n759\t    mean slopes。NORA 的极端 trained slope 突出 architecture-dependent magnitude 但 direction-consistent\n760\t    effect。\n761\t\n762\t    '\n763\t  analysis: '这个轻量 analysis 的 contribution 是将 exit collapse 从 binary (Δ > 0.05?) 转为\n764\t    continuous metric（slope），使得 \"8/10 cells confirm\" 的 narrative 可以升级为 \"trained exit\n765\t    slope significantly steeper than untrained across all 3 architectures (Wilcoxon\n766\t    p=0.002, r=0.81)\"。即使 2 个弱 cell 的 slope 也朝向正确方向（Spatial -0.007 vs untrained -0.003），\n767\t    只是 magnitude 小。OFT Long 是唯一 slope 反转（-0.001 vs -0.003）， 作为 genuine outlier 需要在\n768\t    Limitations 中讨论。 放置位置：Results section 的 cross-architecture summary 段末， 作为 \"quantifying\n769\t    exit collapse sharpness\" 的一段（不值得独立 subsection）。\n770\t\n771\t    '\n772\t- name: aggregate_metrics_summary\n773\t  plan_id: N/A — derived from all completed experiments\n774\t  description: '所有 RUNNING 实验完成后的 aggregate metrics 汇总和更新后的 cross-architecture matrix。\n775\t\n776\t    '\n777\t  expected_results:\n778\t    r2_collapse_confirmed_cells: 8\n779\t    r2_collapse_weak_cells: 2\n780\t    r2_collapse_weak_identities:\n781\t    - OpenVLA Long (OFT)\n782\t    - OpenVLA Spatial\n783\t    total_matrix_cells: 10\n784\t    impossible_cells: 2\n785\t    impossible_identities:\n786\t    - NORA Object (no checkpoint)\n787\t    - NORA Long (no checkpoint)\n788\t    mean_trained_exit_delta_all_10: 0.215\n789\t    mean_trained_exit_delta_confirmed_8: 0.264\n790\t    cf_sensitivity_ratios:\n791\t      tracvla_goal: 10×\n792\t      tracvla_spatial: 7×\n793\t      tracvla_object: 7×\n794\t      tracvla_long: 8×\n795\t      nora_goal: extreme (saturated)\n796\t      nora_spatial: extreme\n797\t      openvla_object: ~2×\n798\t      openvla_goal: 1.12×\n799\t      openvla_spatial: 0.81× (inverted)\n800\t      openvla_long: ~1×\n801\t      geometric_mean_all: 3.4\n802\t      geometric_mean_excluding_openvla: 7.8\n803\t      note: OpenVLA OXE baseline inflates denominator, pulling ratio down\n804\t    matrix_cells_with_full_data: 8\n805\t    cells_with_partial_data: 2\n806\t    partial_data_identities:\n807\t    - NORA Goal (trained CF saturated at cos=1.0)\n808\t    - NORA Spatial (pipeline_v2 metrics incomplete)\n809\t    cross_arch_r2_peak_layer:\n810\t      all_cells:\n811\t      - 13\n812\t      - 12\n813\t      - 14\n814\t      - 15\n815\t      - 4\n816\t      - 17\n817\t      - 9\n818\t      - 11\n819\t      - 10\n820\t      - 12\n821\t      mean: 11.7\n822\t      std: 3.4\n823\t      per_architecture_means:\n824\t        openvla: 13.5\n825\t        tracvla: 10.25\n826\t        nora: 11.0\n827\t    expected_reviewer_scores:\n828\t    - 6\n829\t    - 5\n830\t    - 5\n831\t    - 4\n832\t    expected_reviewer_avg_score: 5.0\n833\t    accept_probability: 0.35\n834\t  result_rationale: \"Aggregate metrics 在 median 档预期范围内： - r2_collapse_confirmed_cells\\\n835\t    \\ = 8，在 [7,9] 范围 ✓ - mean_trained_exit_delta = 0.215，在 [0.1,0.22] 范围高端 ✓ - cf_sensitivity_ratio\\\n836\t    \\ geometric mean = 3.4，略低于 [4,8] 下限\\n  （被 OpenVLA OXE baseline 拉低），需要 excluding-OpenVLA\\\n837\t    \\ 的 7.8 来补救\\n- matrix_cells_with_full_data = 8，在 [7,9] 范围 ✓ - cross_arch_r2_peak_layer_std\\\n838\t    \\ = 3.4，在 [3.0,5.0] 范围 ✓ - expected_reviewer_avg = 5.0，在 [4.5,5.5] 范围 ✓ - accept_probability\\\n839\t    \\ = 0.35，在 [0.25,0.45] 范围 ✓\\nCF ratio 落在 range 下限之下是 median 档的关键风险： 如果 reviewers\\\n840\t    \\ 看的是 all-architecture average（3.4×），会认为 \\\"training does not consistently enhance\\\n841\t    \\ instruction sensitivity\\\"。 论文需要 proactively split the reporting： \\\"For architectures\\\n842\t    \\ where untrained = VLM base (Tier-1), CF ratio is 7-10×. For OpenVLA where untrained\\\n843\t    \\ = OXE-pretrained (Tier-2), CF ratio is 0.8-2×, reflecting the strong baseline\\\n844\t    \\ established by general action training.\\\"\\n\"\n845\t  tables:\n846\t  - title: Updated Cross-Architecture R² Exit Collapse Matrix (Median Tier)\n847\t    columns:\n848\t    - Architecture (Backbone)\n849\t    - Goal\n850\t    - Spatial\n851\t    - Object\n852\t    - Long\n853\t    rows:\n854\t    - - OpenVLA (Llama-2-7B)\n855\t      - Δ=0.141 ✓\n856\t      - Δ=0.037 △\n857\t      - Δ=0.121 ✓\n858\t      - Δ=0.004 △ OFT\n859\t    - - TracVLA (Phi-3-mini)\n860\t      - Δ=0.228 ✓\n861\t      - Δ=0.138 ✓\n862\t      - Δ=0.294 ✓\n863\t      - Δ=0.198 ✓\n864\t    - - NORA (Qwen2.5-VL-3B)\n865\t      - Δ=0.691 ✓\n866\t      - Δ=0.302 ✓\n867\t      - — (no ckpt)\n868\t      - — (no ckpt)\n869\t  - title: Updated L1 Instruction-Dominant Heads Matrix\n870\t    columns:\n871\t    - Architecture\n872\t    - Suite\n873\t    - Trained\n874\t    - Untrained\n875\t    - Training Effect?\n876\t    rows:\n877\t    - - OpenVLA\n878\t      - Goal\n879\t      - 24/32\n880\t      - 25/32 (OXE)\n881\t      - ✗ base-model\n882\t    - - OpenVLA\n883\t      - Spatial\n884\t      - 22/32\n885\t      - 25/32 (OXE)\n886\t      - ✗ base-model\n887\t    - - OpenVLA\n888\t      - Object\n889\t      - 24/32\n890\t      - 24/32 (OXE)\n891\t      - ✗ base-model\n892\t    - - OpenVLA\n893\t      - Long (OFT)\n894\t      - 14/32\n895\t      - 25/32 (OXE)\n896\t      - ✗ OFT reduces\n897\t    - - TracVLA\n898\t      - All 4\n899\t      - 27-30/32\n900\t      - 32/32 (Phi-3)\n901\t      - ✗ base-model\n902\t    - - NORA\n903\t      - Goal\n904\t      - 13/16\n905\t      - 13/16 (Qwen)\n906\t      - ✗ base-model\n907\t    - - NORA\n908\t      - Spatial\n909\t      - 12/16\n910\t      - 14/16 (Qwen)\n911\t      - ✗ base-model\n912\t  - title: Median Tier Reviewer Score Prediction\n913\t    columns:\n914\t    - Reviewer\n915\t    - Score\n916\t    - Stance\n917\t    - Key Concern\n918\t    rows:\n919\t    - - R1 (Champion)\n920\t      - '6'\n921\t      - Accept\n922\t      - Novel framework, R² collapse convincing across 8/10 cells\n923\t    - - R2 (Borderline)\n924\t      - '5'\n925\t      - Weak Accept\n926\t      - OpenVLA 2/4 weak cells; 'architecture-independent' overstated\n927\t    - - R3 (Borderline)\n928\t      - '5'\n929\t      - Borderline\n930\t      - Three-tier gradient only 1 Tier-2 datapoint; suggestive not validated\n931\t    - - R4 (Skeptic)\n932\t      - '4'\n933\t      - Weak Reject\n934\t      - No behavioral evidence; CF ratio inconsistent; C3 is null\n935\t  - title: Three-Tier Routing Gradient Evidence (Median Tier Assessment)\n936\t    columns:\n937\t    - Tier\n938\t    - Example\n939\t    - L1 Heads\n940\t    - CF d (empty)\n941\t    - R² Collapse?\n942\t    - Evidence Strength\n943\t    rows:\n944\t    - - 'Tier 1: VLM Base'\n945\t      - Phi-3-Vision / Qwen2.5-VL\n946\t      - 28-32/32\n947\t      - cos 0.14-0.17\n948\t      - 'No'\n949\t      - Strong (4 VLMs)\n950\t    - - 'Tier 2: OXE Pretrained'\n951\t      - openvla-7b (970K ep)\n952\t      - 25/32\n953\t      - d ≈ 1.05\n954\t      - 'No'\n955\t      - Weak (n=1)\n956\t    - - 'Tier 3: Task-finetuned'\n957\t      - All 3 trained VLAs\n958\t      - 13-30\n959\t      - d ≈ 0.8-1.5\n960\t      - 8/10 cells\n961\t      - Moderate\n962\t  figures_description:\n963\t  - 'Cross-architecture heatmap: 3 rows (architectures) × 4 columns (suites)， color\n964\t    = Δ(peak-exit)，0-0.7 color scale。 8 cells green (confirmed)，2 cells yellow (weak)，2\n965\t    cells grey (no checkpoint)。 注释每个 cell 的 Δ 值。 Title: \"R² Exit Collapse Across Architectures\n966\t    and Task Suites\"\n967\t\n968\t    '\n969\t  - 'Three-tier gradient schematic: 横轴 = training stage (VLM → OXE → Task-finetuned)，\n970\t    纵轴 = R² exit collapse magnitude。三个阶段用不同颜色标注， Tier-2 用虚线圆圈标记 \"n=1, suggestive\"。\n971\t\n972\t    '\n973\t  analysis: 'Median 档的核心 tension： R² exit collapse 在 8/10 cells 确认，是一个 reasonably\n974\t    robust finding—— 但 2 个弱 cell 都在 OpenVLA，使得按 architecture 分组的通过率是 OpenVLA 2/4 (50%),\n975\t    TracVLA 4/4 (100%), NORA 2/2 (100%)。 Reviewers 可以合理质疑：\"如果最深入研究的架构（OpenVLA，4 papers\n976\t    已发） 只有 50% 通过率，凭什么 claim architecture-independent？\"\n977\t\n978\t    回应策略： （1）区分 2 个弱 cell 的成因——OFT 是 training method confound（不是 full fine-tuning），\n979\t    Spatial 是 pretraining coverage confound（OXE 已覆盖）——都不是 architecture confound。 （2）强调\n980\t    R² collapse 的 direction 在 8/10 cells 一致（trained Δ > untrained Δ）， 2 个弱 cell 也朝正确方向，只是\n981\t    magnitude 不足 threshold。 （3）用 exit-collapse-rate analysis 提供 population-level 统计（p=0.002）\n982\t    作为 beyond-threshold 的 continuous evidence。\n983\t\n984\t    三层级梯度是最 vulnerable 的 contribution：仅 1 个 Tier-2 datapoint （OXE openvla-7b），R3 会说\n985\t    \"this is a single observation, not a gradient\"。 论文需要降为 \"suggestive observation\n986\t    warranting further investigation with additional OXE-pretrained checkpoints (e.g.,\n987\t    RT-2-X, Octo)\"。\n988\t\n989\t    Accept probability 0.35：需要 R1 champion 推动，R2 被 rebuttal 说服， R3 接受 three-tier 降为\n990\t    observation，R4 的 behavioral concern 用 \"future work\" + \"this paper''s contribution\n991\t    is representational analysis, not behavioral validation\" 来 address。 AC leaning:\n992\t    \"interesting findings but claims should be tempered; accept if authors commit\n993\t    to qualifying ''architecture-independent'' claim and acknowledging behavioral\n994\t    validation gap.\"'\n995\t"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"26867879-adf3-4c14-9393-b9045e867606","uuid":"3cfaf92d-ba80-496b-82d6-ed71ca0d70a5","timestamp":"2026-05-27T02:35:40.005Z","tool_use_result":{"type":"text","file":{"filePath":"/home/ubuntu/.agent-ml-research-idea_gen_0509_15/projects/vla-ssd/artifacts/dream_reports/dream_20260522T021705/median/imagined_experiments.yaml","content":"tier: median\nnarrative_guidance: 'Median 档下，R² exit collapse 在 8/10 cells 确认但 OpenVLA 有 2 个弱 cell（Long\n  OFT + Spatial）， 削弱 \"architecture-independent\" 的绝对性，需降为 \"consistent across three\n  tested architectures with caveats\"。D090 区分（training-induced vs base-model-dependent）成为双刃剑：区分本身是\n  honest science，但 reviewers 会追问 \"如果 L1 heads 来自预训练，training 到底贡献了什么？\"。 三层级梯度仅 1 个\n  Tier-2 数据点（OXE openvla-7b），被降为 suggestive observation。 CF sensitivity ratio 被 OpenVLA\n  OXE baseline 的高 CF 拉低（OXE 本身 d≈1.0， 训练后仅 d≈1.15，ratio 仅 1.1×），与 TracVLA 10× 形成鲜明对比，\n  暴露 \"cross-architecture CF ratio\" 实际是 \"cross-baseline CF ratio\" 问题。 NORA 仅 2/4 suites\n  被视为 incomplete。C3 移入 appendix。 需要 1 个轻量 additional analysis 补偿 contribution density，\n  推荐 exit-collapse-rate analysis（无新 GPU 成本，用已有 R² profiles 计算 exit 层衰减斜率）。 仍可 accept\n  但需要 reviewer champion，accept probability ≈ 0.35。\n\n  '\nimagined_experiments:\n- name: openvla_goal_standardized_v1\n  plan_id: N/A — registry-level, fills OpenVLA × Goal cell in 3×4 matrix\n  description: 'OpenVLA (Llama-2-7B) on LIBERO-Goal 的标准化 5-phase pipeline： R² probing、L1\n    attention、cross-instruction classification、RSA、counterfactual。 Trained = openvla-7b-finetuned-libero-goal，Untrained\n    = openvla-7b (OXE pretrained, Tier-2)。 10 tasks × 10 demos × 50 timesteps。 Median\n    档预测：确认 R² exit collapse（Δ=0.141），但 CF ratio 偏低（1.12×） 因 OXE baseline 本身已有强 CF\n    sensitivity。\n\n    '\n  expected_results:\n    trained_r2_last_preaction:\n      L0: 0.561\n      L4: 0.638\n      L8: 0.659\n      L12: 0.672\n      L16: 0.651\n      L20: 0.623\n      L24: 0.589\n      L28: 0.556\n      L31: 0.531\n      peak_layer: 12\n      peak_r2: 0.672\n      exit_r2: 0.531\n      delta_peak_exit: 0.141\n    trained_r2_image_mean:\n      L0: 0.636\n      L4: 0.647\n      L8: 0.658\n      L10: 0.661\n      L12: 0.655\n      L16: 0.639\n      L20: 0.612\n      L24: 0.594\n      L28: 0.587\n      L31: 0.578\n      peak_layer: 10\n      peak_r2: 0.661\n    untrained_r2_last_preaction:\n      L0: 0.608\n      L4: 0.776\n      L8: 0.795\n      L12: 0.807\n      L16: 0.812\n      L20: 0.819\n      L21: 0.822\n      L24: 0.818\n      L28: 0.813\n      L31: 0.808\n      peak_layer: 21\n      peak_r2: 0.822\n      exit_r2: 0.808\n      delta_peak_exit: 0.014\n    untrained_r2_image_mean:\n      L0: 0.826\n      L4: 0.833\n      L8: 0.837\n      L12: 0.846\n      L16: 0.843\n      L20: 0.838\n      L24: 0.839\n      L28: 0.841\n      L31: 0.836\n      peak_layer: 12\n      peak_r2: 0.846\n    trained_l1_attention:\n      instruction_dominant: 24\n      mixed: 4\n      image_dominant: 4\n      total_heads: 32\n      mean_text_attn: 0.571\n      mean_image_attn: 0.218\n    untrained_l1_attention:\n      instruction_dominant: 25\n      mixed: 7\n      image_dominant: 0\n      total_heads: 32\n      mean_text_attn: 0.672\n      mean_image_attn: 0.221\n    trained_cross_instruction:\n      image_mean_all_layers: 0.1\n      last_preaction_L0: 0.1\n      last_preaction_L1: 0.997\n      last_preaction_L2_plus: 1.0\n    untrained_cross_instruction:\n      image_mean_all_layers: 0.1\n      last_preaction_all_layers: 1.0\n      note: OXE model maintains 100% classification accuracy at all layers — no deep-layer\n        degradation\n    trained_counterfactual:\n      empty_d: 1.15\n      wrong_d: 0.93\n      shuffled_d: 0.72\n      paraphrased_d: 0.62\n      ranking: empty > wrong > shuffled > paraphrased\n    untrained_counterfactual:\n      empty_d: 1.03\n      wrong_d: 0.82\n      shuffled_d: 0.61\n      paraphrased_d: 0.59\n      ranking: empty > wrong > shuffled > paraphrased\n    cf_ratio_empty: 1.12\n    trained_rsa_peak:\n      layer: 12\n      rsa: 0.497\n    untrained_rsa_peak:\n      layer: 12\n      rsa: 0.518\n    r2_exit_collapse_confirmed: true\n    training_induced: true\n    delta_trained_vs_untrained: 0.127\n  result_rationale: 'Goal 确认 collapse 的逻辑：（1）LIBERO-Goal 任务需要 instruction routing\n    来识别 目标物体（\"pick up the red mug\" vs \"pick up the blue cup\"），训练将这种 routing 从 OXE\n    的 diffuse mid-layer 模式重组为 entry-exit bookend 模式； （2）R² exit collapse（Δ=0.141）的量级与\n    OpenVLA Object（Δ=0.121）一致， 表明 Goal/Object 类任务在 OpenVLA 上稳定产生 training-induced\n    collapse； （3）但 CF ratio 仅 1.12×（trained d=1.15 / OXE d=1.03），远低于 TracVLA 10×，\n    因为 OXE 在 970K diverse episodes 上已建立强 instruction sensitivity—— LIBERO fine-tuning\n    只做边际提升，而非从零创建； （4）L1 heads 几乎不变（trained 24 vs OXE 25），进一步确认 D090： L1 routing 是\n    base-model 继承的，不是 LIBERO 训练创造的； （5）Untrained R² profile 极其平坦（Δ=0.014），与 Long untrained（Δ=0.016）一致，\n    说明 OXE 预训练创造的是均匀的 representation preservation，而非 exit collapse。 OXE model cross-instruction\n    全层 100% 也表明 Tier-2 已有完善的 language routing。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - title: OpenVLA Goal R² Exit Collapse Comparison\n    columns:\n    - Condition\n    - Peak Layer\n    - Peak R²\n    - Exit R² (L31)\n    - Δ(peak−exit)\n    - Collapse?\n    rows:\n    - - Trained (LIBERO-Goal)\n      - L12\n      - '0.672'\n      - '0.531'\n      - '0.141'\n      - ✓\n    - - Untrained (OXE)\n      - L21\n      - '0.822'\n      - '0.808'\n      - '0.014'\n      - ✗\n  - title: OpenVLA Goal L1 Attention Comparison\n    columns:\n    - Metric\n    - Trained\n    - Untrained (OXE)\n    - Δ\n    rows:\n    - - Instruction-dominant heads\n      - 24/32\n      - 25/32\n      - '-1'\n    - - Mean text attention\n      - '0.571'\n      - '0.672'\n      - '-0.101'\n    - - Mean image attention\n      - '0.218'\n      - '0.221'\n      - '-0.003'\n  - title: OpenVLA Goal CF Sensitivity\n    columns:\n    - Condition\n    - Empty d\n    - Wrong d\n    - Shuffled d\n    - Para d\n    rows:\n    - - Trained\n      - '1.15'\n      - '0.93'\n      - '0.72'\n      - '0.62'\n    - - Untrained (OXE)\n      - '1.03'\n      - '0.82'\n      - '0.61'\n      - '0.59'\n    - - Ratio\n      - 1.12×\n      - 1.13×\n      - 1.18×\n      - 1.05×\n  figures_description:\n  - 'R² per-layer profile (last_preaction): trained 显示经典 inverted-U（peak L12=0.672）\n    并在 exit 层急剧下降至 0.531；OXE untrained 为近乎平坦曲线（0.78-0.82）， 两条线在 L0-L4 和 L28-L31 区间交叉，中间层\n    trained 高于 untrained。 明确标注 Δ(peak-exit) = 0.141 vs 0.014。\n\n    '\n  - 'L1 attention heatmap：两条件几乎相同（24 vs 25 instruction-dominant heads）， 视觉上突出 D090\n    finding——L1 routing 来自 OXE 预训练而非 LIBERO fine-tuning。\n\n    '\n  analysis: 'Goal cell 成功确认 R² exit collapse 的 training-induced 性质。 但该 cell 同时暴露 OpenVLA\n    特有问题：OXE untrained baseline 极强 （R² flat ~0.82, CF d≈1.0, L1 25/32 heads, cross-instruction\n    100%）， 导致 trained-untrained 对比的 margin 远小于 TracVLA/NORA（Tier-3 vs Tier-1）。 这使得\n    \"cross-architecture CF ratio\" 实际上是 \"cross-baseline sensitivity ratio\"， 需要在论文中显式说明。对\n    reviewer 而言，Goal 的 R² collapse 是干净的， 但 CF 和 L1 数据不提供额外支持。\n\n    '\n- name: openvla_spatial_standardized_v1\n  plan_id: N/A — registry-level, fills OpenVLA × Spatial cell in 3×4 matrix\n  description: 'OpenVLA on LIBERO-Spatial 的标准化 5-phase pipeline。 Median 档预测：R² exit\n    collapse 偏弱（Δ=0.037 < 0.05），成为第二个弱 cell （与 Long OFT 并列）。成因不同于 OFT：Spatial 任务的\n    instruction routing 需求 较低（空间关系主要由视觉编码器处理），加上 OXE pretraining 已涵盖大量 spatial manipulation\n    数据，LIBERO Spatial 的边际贡献极小。\n\n    '\n  expected_results:\n    trained_r2_last_preaction:\n      L0: 0.558\n      L4: 0.641\n      L8: 0.668\n      L12: 0.674\n      L14: 0.679\n      L16: 0.672\n      L20: 0.657\n      L24: 0.649\n      L28: 0.645\n      L31: 0.642\n      peak_layer: 14\n      peak_r2: 0.679\n      exit_r2: 0.642\n      delta_peak_exit: 0.037\n    trained_r2_image_mean:\n      L0: 0.642\n      L4: 0.651\n      L8: 0.665\n      L11: 0.67\n      L12: 0.669\n      L16: 0.651\n      L20: 0.634\n      L24: 0.622\n      L28: 0.618\n      L31: 0.612\n      peak_layer: 11\n      peak_r2: 0.67\n    untrained_r2_last_preaction:\n      L0: 0.611\n      L4: 0.779\n      L8: 0.798\n      L12: 0.811\n      L16: 0.816\n      L20: 0.821\n      L22: 0.824\n      L24: 0.82\n      L28: 0.815\n      L31: 0.811\n      peak_layer: 22\n      peak_r2: 0.824\n      exit_r2: 0.811\n      delta_peak_exit: 0.013\n    untrained_r2_image_mean:\n      L0: 0.828\n      L4: 0.835\n      L8: 0.84\n      L12: 0.849\n      L16: 0.845\n      L20: 0.84\n      L24: 0.841\n      L28: 0.843\n      L31: 0.838\n      peak_layer: 12\n      peak_r2: 0.849\n    trained_l1_attention:\n      instruction_dominant: 22\n      mixed: 5\n      image_dominant: 5\n      total_heads: 32\n      mean_text_attn: 0.527\n      mean_image_attn: 0.258\n    untrained_l1_attention:\n      instruction_dominant: 25\n      mixed: 7\n      image_dominant: 0\n      total_heads: 32\n      mean_text_attn: 0.668\n      mean_image_attn: 0.225\n    trained_cross_instruction:\n      image_mean_all_layers: 0.1\n      last_preaction_L0: 0.1\n      last_preaction_L1: 0.989\n      last_preaction_L2_plus: 1.0\n    untrained_cross_instruction:\n      last_preaction_all_layers: 1.0\n    trained_counterfactual:\n      empty_d: 0.82\n      wrong_d: 0.68\n      shuffled_d: 0.56\n      paraphrased_d: 0.49\n    untrained_counterfactual:\n      empty_d: 1.01\n      wrong_d: 0.8\n      shuffled_d: 0.59\n      paraphrased_d: 0.57\n    cf_ratio_empty: 0.81\n    cf_ratio_note: Trained CF LOWER than untrained — OXE 的 spatial 泛化能力被 LIBERO fine-tuning\n      部分覆写\n    trained_rsa_peak:\n      layer: 14\n      rsa: 0.502\n    untrained_rsa_peak:\n      layer: 12\n      rsa: 0.521\n    r2_exit_collapse_confirmed: false\n    training_induced: weak\n    delta_trained_vs_untrained: 0.024\n    verdict: △ — Δ=0.037 存在但 < 0.05 threshold; trained CF 低于 untrained\n  result_rationale: 'Spatial 弱效应的三层原因： （1）Task 特性：LIBERO-Spatial 的 instruction 主要指定空间关系（\"put\n    X on the left of Y\"），routing 需求集中在 spatial parsing 而非 goal identification。 Vision\n    encoder + OXE pretraining 已提供充分的 spatial representation， LIBERO fine-tuning 对\n    instruction routing 的边际改造极小。 （2）OXE coverage：Open X-Embodiment 970K episodes 包含大量\n    kitchen/tabletop spatial manipulation 任务（Bridge, RT-1, TOTO 等），OXE pretrained\n    model 已经在 spatial reasoning 上饱和——不像 Goal 任务中存在特异性目标物体需要额外学习。 （3）R² profile 解读：trained\n    last_preaction 呈现 shallow inverted-U （peak L14=0.679, exit L31=0.642, Δ=0.037），相比\n    Goal（Δ=0.141） 衰减幅度小 3.8×。exit layer 仍保留较高 R²（0.642 vs Goal 的 0.531）， 说明训练未充分 \"collapse\"\n    exit 层信息。 CF ratio < 1（trained 0.82 < untrained 1.01）是最具挑战性的结果： 意味着 LIBERO Spatial\n    fine-tuning 反而降低了整体 instruction sensitivity。 解读：OXE 的 generalist sensitivity 被\n    specialist fine-tuning 部分覆写为 task-specific pattern，总量下降但方向性更强（更 task-aligned 而非更\n    sensitive）。 Reviewer 会质疑：\"如果训练降低 CF sensitivity，你怎么能 claim training improves routing？\"\n    回应需要精细区分 sensitivity 和 specificity。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - title: OpenVLA Spatial R² Exit Collapse Comparison\n    columns:\n    - Condition\n    - Peak Layer\n    - Peak R²\n    - Exit R² (L31)\n    - Δ(peak−exit)\n    - Collapse?\n    rows:\n    - - Trained (LIBERO-Spatial)\n      - L14\n      - '0.679'\n      - '0.642'\n      - '0.037'\n      - △ weak\n    - - Untrained (OXE)\n      - L22\n      - '0.824'\n      - '0.811'\n      - '0.013'\n      - ✗\n  - title: OpenVLA Spatial CF Sensitivity — Trained LOWER than Untrained\n    columns:\n    - Condition\n    - Empty d\n    - Wrong d\n    - Shuffled d\n    - Para d\n    rows:\n    - - Trained\n      - '0.82'\n      - '0.68'\n      - '0.56'\n      - '0.49'\n    - - Untrained (OXE)\n      - '1.01'\n      - '0.80'\n      - '0.59'\n      - '0.57'\n    - - Ratio (T/U)\n      - 0.81×\n      - 0.85×\n      - 0.95×\n      - 0.86×\n  - title: OpenVLA 4-Suite Summary — 2 strong, 2 weak\n    columns:\n    - Suite\n    - Trained Δ(peak−exit)\n    - CF Ratio\n    - Collapse?\n    - Issue\n    rows:\n    - - Object\n      - '0.121'\n      - ~2×\n      - ✓\n      - —\n    - - Goal\n      - '0.141'\n      - 1.12×\n      - ✓\n      - CF ratio low\n    - - Spatial\n      - '0.037'\n      - 0.81×\n      - △\n      - Δ < 0.05, CF inverted\n    - - Long (OFT)\n      - '0.004'\n      - ~1×\n      - △\n      - OFT training confound\n  figures_description:\n  - 'R² last_preaction 4-suite overlay for OpenVLA trained：Object (Δ=0.121) 和 Goal\n    (Δ=0.141) 展示清晰 exit collapse；Spatial (Δ=0.037) 呈 shallow decline； Long OFT (Δ=0.004)\n    几乎平坦。形成从强到弱的连续谱系， 标注 Δ < 0.05 threshold line。\n\n    '\n  - 'Trained vs Untrained CF d scatter plot：x=untrained d, y=trained d, 点标注 suite\n    name。Goal 在 y=x 线略上方，Spatial 在线下方（唯一反转 cell）， Long 接近对角线。对角线上方 = training increases\n    CF，下方 = training decreases CF。\n\n    '\n  analysis: 'Spatial 弱 cell 与 Long OFT 弱 cell 的成因不同： OFT 是因为 parameter-efficient fine-tuning\n    限制了权重变化幅度（frozen majority weights）， Spatial 是因为 OXE pretraining 已充分覆盖了 spatial\n    reasoning task space。 两者共同削弱 \"architecture-independent\" 的绝对性，但方式互补： OFT 说明 training\n    method matters，Spatial 说明 pretraining coverage matters。 论文需要承认这些 nuances 并将 claim\n    降为 \"consistent across three tested architectures in 8/10 cells, with two exceptions\n    attributable to specific training configurations\"。 对 acceptance 的影响：Spatial 的\n    CF inversion 是最 damaging 的数据点， reviewer 可以用它论证 \"training does not consistently\n    enhance instruction routing\"。 反驳策略：强调 R² collapse 是 robust metric（8/10 cells），CF\n    是 secondary indicator 且受 baseline strength 影响，Spatial 的 inverted CF 恰恰说明 specialist\n    fine-tuning trades breadth for depth。\n\n    '\n- name: cf_batch_missing_v1\n  plan_id: N/A — registry-level batch job filling 5 missing untrained CF cells\n  description: '批量补跑 5 个 untrained counterfactual cells，使用 cosine_dist 方法 （untrained\n    VLM/VLA 的 hidden representation cosine distance，非 action-space d）。 条件：OpenVLA\n    Object untrained (OXE), TracVLA Spatial/Object/Goal/Long untrained (Phi-3-Vision)。\n    已完成执行，进入 ANALYZING 状态。 Median 档预测：所有 5 条件成功产出，但 OpenVLA untrained (OXE) 与 TracVLA\n    untrained (Phi-3 base) 的 cos_dist 量级差异大（OXE >> Phi-3），暴露跨架构对比的 baseline 不均。\n\n    '\n  expected_results:\n    openvla_object_untrained:\n      method: cosine_dist_L31\n      empty:\n        cos_dist: 0.238\n        cohens_d: 12.4\n      wrong:\n        cos_dist: 0.231\n        cohens_d: 8.7\n      shuffled:\n        cos_dist: 0.189\n        cohens_d: 7.2\n      paraphrased:\n        cos_dist: 0.073\n        cohens_d: 5.1\n      ordering: empty ≈ wrong >> shuffled >> paraphrased\n      note: OXE model cos_dist 远高于 Phi-3 base — OXE 的 instruction sensitivity 强\n    tracvla_spatial_untrained:\n      method: cosine_dist_L31\n      empty:\n        cos_dist: 0.142\n        cohens_d: 9.8\n      wrong:\n        cos_dist: 0.018\n        cohens_d: 1.6\n      shuffled:\n        cos_dist: 0.091\n        cohens_d: 1.9\n      paraphrased:\n        cos_dist: 0.005\n        cohens_d: 1.8\n      ordering: empty >> shuffled > wrong > paraphrased\n    tracvla_object_untrained:\n      method: cosine_dist_L31\n      empty:\n        cos_dist: 0.151\n        cohens_d: 10.1\n      wrong:\n        cos_dist: 0.019\n        cohens_d: 1.7\n      shuffled:\n        cos_dist: 0.097\n        cohens_d: 2.0\n      paraphrased:\n        cos_dist: 0.005\n        cohens_d: 1.9\n      ordering: empty >> shuffled > wrong ≈ paraphrased\n    tracvla_goal_untrained:\n      method: cosine_dist_L31\n      empty:\n        cos_dist: 0.148\n        cohens_d: 9.5\n      wrong:\n        cos_dist: 0.017\n        cohens_d: 1.4\n      shuffled:\n        cos_dist: 0.085\n        cohens_d: 1.5\n      paraphrased:\n        cos_dist: 0.004\n        cohens_d: 1.7\n      ordering: empty >> shuffled > wrong > paraphrased\n    tracvla_long_untrained:\n      method: cosine_dist_L31\n      empty:\n        cos_dist: 0.168\n        cohens_d: 11.0\n      wrong:\n        cos_dist: 0.022\n        cohens_d: 1.8\n      shuffled:\n        cos_dist: 0.116\n        cohens_d: 2.1\n      paraphrased:\n        cos_dist: 0.007\n        cohens_d: 1.7\n      ordering: empty >> shuffled > wrong > paraphrased\n    cross_condition_pattern: 'Universal ordering for Phi-3 base: empty >> shuffled\n      > {wrong, para}。 Structural perturbation (empty = remove all tokens) > reordering\n      (shuffled) > semantic (wrong, para)。 与 trained CF ordering (empty > wrong >\n      shuffled > para) 不同 — training reshapes ordering from structural-dominance to\n      semantic-sensitivity。 OXE untrained ordering closer to trained pattern (empty\n      ≈ wrong >> shuffled) because OXE already has semantic routing。\n\n      '\n    matrix_completeness_after:\n      total_cf_cells: 20\n      filled_before: 14\n      filled_after: 19\n      still_missing: NORA Spatial untrained CF (potentially in nora_spatial_pipeline_v2)\n  result_rationale: '（1）Phi-3-Vision base (TracVLA untrained) 的 cos_dist 模式一致且量级偏低\n    （empty cos_dist 0.14-0.17，wrong/para 仅 0.005-0.022），因为 Phi-3 base 是纯 VLM， instruction\n    虽被 attend to（L1 32/32 heads）但不 condition action-relevant computation （无 action\n    training），perturbation 仅引起浅层 representation shift。 Empty 的 cos_dist 远超其他条件（10-30×）是因为\n    empty = 完全移除 instruction tokens 改变了 sequence structure，产生 structural 而非 semantic\n    的 representation change。 （2）OXE untrained 的 cos_dist 显著更高（wrong=0.231 vs Phi-3\n    0.017-0.022）， 因为 OXE 模型经过 action training，instruction perturbation 通过 routing\n    mechanism 传导到 deeper representation layers，产生更大的 hidden state 偏移。 这进一步佐证 Tier-2\n    vs Tier-1 的区别。 （3）Ordering 差异（Phi-3: empty >> shuffled > wrong vs OXE: empty ≈\n    wrong >> shuffled） 反映 training 如何 reshape sensitivity：untrained VLM 对 structural\n    perturbation 最敏感 （因为没有 learned semantic routing），trained VLA 对 semantic perturbation\n    更敏感 （因为 learned instruction-conditioned routing 依赖 semantic content）。 （4）对 median\n    档的影响：这批数据完成后 CF matrix 从 14/20 → 19/20 cells， 大幅提升 completeness，但同时暴露了 OXE vs\n    Phi-3 baseline 的巨大量级差异， 使得 \"cross-architecture CF comparison\" 需要 careful normalization\n    或 separate discussion。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - title: Untrained CF Cosine Distance Summary (cf_batch_missing)\n    columns:\n    - Architecture\n    - Suite\n    - Empty cos\n    - Wrong cos\n    - Shuffled cos\n    - Para cos\n    rows:\n    - - OpenVLA (OXE)\n      - Object\n      - '0.238'\n      - '0.231'\n      - '0.189'\n      - '0.073'\n    - - TracVLA (Phi-3)\n      - Spatial\n      - '0.142'\n      - '0.018'\n      - '0.091'\n      - '0.005'\n    - - TracVLA (Phi-3)\n      - Object\n      - '0.151'\n      - '0.019'\n      - '0.097'\n      - '0.005'\n    - - TracVLA (Phi-3)\n      - Goal\n      - '0.148'\n      - '0.017'\n      - '0.085'\n      - '0.004'\n    - - TracVLA (Phi-3)\n      - Long\n      - '0.168'\n      - '0.022'\n      - '0.116'\n      - '0.007'\n  - title: 'CF Ordering Comparison: VLM Base vs OXE vs Trained'\n    columns:\n    - Condition Type\n    - CF Ordering\n    - Interpretation\n    rows:\n    - - VLM base (Phi-3/Qwen2.5)\n      - empty >> shuffled > wrong ≈ para\n      - Structural sensitivi